#: src/run.md
msgid "誰が止めたかは、pagetray からは見えない。機械の側の記録を見る"
msgstr "pagetray cannot see who stopped it. Check the host's own logs"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`previous: got a stop signal but did not finish (…)`"
msgstr "`previous: got a stop signal but did not finish (…)`"

#: src/run.md
msgid "止める合図は受けたが、閉じ終える前に切られた"
msgstr "Got a stop signal, but was cut off before it finished closing"

#: src/run.md
msgid "同じ"
msgstr "Same"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`previous: panicked (…)`"
msgstr "`previous: panicked (…)`"

#: src/run.md
msgid "pagetray の中の誤り。行に、場所（file と行の番号）と文が入る"
msgstr ""
"A bug inside pagetray. The line carries the location (file and line number) "
"and the message"

#: src/run.md
msgid "その場所と、`server.log` のその時刻の前の行"
msgstr "That location, and the lines in `server.log` just before that time"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`previous: failed (…)`"
msgstr "`previous: failed (…)`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"起きられずに終わった（DB を開けない・移行に落ちた・待ち受けられない）。行に訳"
"が入る"
msgstr ""
"It ended without starting (could not open the DB, a migration failed, could "
"not listen). The line carries the reason"

#: src/run.md
msgid "行の訳"
msgstr "The reason in the line"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`previous: no stop mark (…; last alive …)`"
msgstr "`previous: no stop mark (…; last alive …)`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"合図も来ず、何も書けずに終わった（SIGKILL・メモリ不足・VM ごと切られた）。"
"`last alive` は最後に生きていた時刻で、落ちたのはその後の 30 秒の内"
msgstr ""
"It ended with no signal and no chance to write anything (SIGKILL, out of "
"memory, the VM was cut off). `last alive` is the last heartbeat; it went "
"down within 30 seconds after that"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`server.log` のその時刻の前の行と、機械の側の記録"
msgstr ""
"The lines in `server.log` just before that time, and the host's own logs"

#: src/run.md
msgid "4 MiB に入るのは、問い合わせの行でおよそ 2 万行。"
msgstr "4 MiB holds roughly 20,000 request lines."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"記録を書けない時（volume が満ちた、など）も pagetray は動く。行は捨て、"
"`container logs` には、書けなくなった時と戻った時に 1 行ずつ出る。"
msgstr ""
"pagetray keeps running even when it cannot write the logs (a full volume, "
"for example). The lines are dropped, and `container logs` shows one line "
"when writing stops working and one when it works again."

#: src/run.md
msgid "「DB の写しを取る」の写しに、記録は入らない。"
msgstr "The backup made by \"Back up the DB\" does not include the logs."

#: src/run.md
msgid "止める・Mac を起こし直した後"
msgstr "Stopping, and after restarting the Mac"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"止めている間、ページは置けず、一覧の UI も開けない（番号をサーバーが決めるた"
"め）。止めるのは `container stop pagetray`。DB は volume に残る。"
msgstr ""
"While it is stopped, pages cannot be put and the list UI cannot be opened "
"(because the server assigns the numbers). To stop it, run `container stop "
"pagetray`. The DB remains in the volume."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"Mac を起こし直すと止まったままになる。`container system start` の後に "
"`container start pagetray` を打ち、「確かめる」をする。"
msgstr ""
"After the Mac is restarted, it stays stopped. Run `container system start`, "
"then `container start pagetray`, and do \"Verify\"."

#: src/run.md
msgid "volume（`pagetray-data-v1`）は消さない。"
msgstr "Do not delete the volume (`pagetray-data-v1`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "版を上げる"
msgstr "Upgrading"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"[CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/blob/main/"
"CHANGELOG.md) で、API の形が替わるか・移行の SQL が足されるかを見る（移行が足"
"された版は、当てた後に前の版へ戻せない。1.0.0 から後の server は、自分より新"
"しい版が移行を足した DB では起きない）。"
msgstr ""
"Check [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/blob/main/"
"CHANGELOG.md) to see whether the API shape changes and whether migration SQL "
"is added (a version that adds migrations cannot be rolled back to the "
"previous version once they are applied. Servers from 1.0.0 on do not start "
"on a database to which a newer version has added migrations)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "新しい版の image を pull し、digest を release の値と見比べる。"
msgstr ""
"Pull the image of the new version and compare its digest with the value in "
"the release."

#: src/run.md
msgid "「DB の写しを取る」をする。"
msgstr "Do \"Back up the DB\"."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container stop pagetray`・`container delete pagetray` の後、新しい版で「起こ"
"す」の `container run` を打ち、「確かめる」をする（volume はそのまま付く）。"
msgstr ""
"After `container stop pagetray` and `container delete pagetray`, run the "
"`container run` from \"Start\" with the new version and do \"Verify\" (the "
"volume attaches as is)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"駄目なら、`container delete pagetray` の後、前の版で `container run` を打つ"
"（移行が足されていなければ、同じ volume で起きる。足されていたら、3 の写しか"
"ら戻す）。"
msgstr ""
"If it fails, run `container delete pagetray` and then `container run` with "
"the previous version (if no migrations were added, it starts with the same "
"volume. If they were, restore from the backup taken in step 3)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "古い image は `container image delete` で消す。"
msgstr "Delete old images with `container image delete`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray` は、置き場を端末から操作する命令。置き場の API（[API の仕様]"
"(api.md)）を HTTP で呼ぶ。相手は、この Mac の中（`127.0.0.1`）の置き場だけ"
"で、認証も設定の file も無い。"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray` is a command for operating the store from a terminal. It calls "
"the store's API ([API specification](api.md)) over HTTP. It only talks to a "
"store on this Mac (`127.0.0.1`); there is no authentication and no "
"configuration file."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "入れる"
msgstr "Installing"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"release に、macOS（arm64）用の binary が付いている。`gh` で取り、checksum を"
"確かめてから置く。"
msgstr ""
"Each release has a binary for macOS (arm64) attached. Download it with `gh`, "
"verify the checksum, and then put it in place."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "\"$(mktemp -d)\""
msgstr "\"$(mktemp -d)\""

#: src/cli.md
msgid "'pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz*'"
msgstr "'pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz*'"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"browser で落とすと、macOS が開くのを止める（公証をしていない binary のた"
"め）。`gh` か `curl` で取る。"
msgstr ""
"If you download it with a browser, macOS refuses to open it (the binary is "
"not notarized). Download it with `gh` or `curl`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"Rust があれば、source からも入る: `cargo install --git https://github.com/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray --tag v<version> --locked pagetray`（package の名。入る"
"命令も `pagetray`）。"
msgstr ""
"If you have Rust, you can also install from source: `cargo install --git "
"https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray --tag v<version> --locked pagetray` "
"(the package name; the installed command is also `pagetray`)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消す時は `rm ~/.local/bin/pagetray`。ほかに置く file は無い。"
msgstr ""
"To remove it, run `rm ~/.local/bin/pagetray`. It places no other files."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "命令"
msgstr "Commands"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "すること"
msgstr "What it does"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray status`"
msgstr "`pagetray status`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場が生きているかと、サーバーの版と CLI の版を出す（`GetHealth`。`--json` "
"は `url`・`server`・`cli`）"
msgstr ""
"Shows whether the store is alive, the server version, and the CLI version "
"(`GetHealth`; `--json` gives `url`, `server`, and `cli`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page list`"
msgstr "`pagetray page list`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを絞って探す（`ListPages`。新しい順）"
msgstr "Finds pages with filters (`ListPages`; newest first)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page view <page>`"
msgstr "`pagetray page view <page>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"ページの本文を出す（手の道）。`--web` で browser に、`-o <file>` で file に"
msgstr ""
"Prints the body of a page (hand-written route). `--web` opens it in the "
"browser, `-o <file>` writes it to a file"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page put <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray page put <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを置く（`CreatePage`。`-` は stdin）。置いたページの URL を出す"
msgstr ""
"Stores a page (`CreatePage`; `-` reads stdin). Prints the URL of the stored "
"page"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page delete <page>…`"
msgstr "`pagetray page delete <page>…`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを消す（`DeletePages`。戻せない。`--yes` の時だけ）"
msgstr "Deletes pages (`DeletePages`; cannot be undone; only with `--yes`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page reply <page>`"
msgstr "`pagetray page reply <page>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"ページの返事の状態を書く（`SetReplyState`）。`--waiting`・`--answered`・`--"
"on`"
msgstr ""
"Writes the reply state of a page (`SetReplyState`). `--waiting`, `--"
"answered`, `--on`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page watch`"
msgstr "`pagetray page watch`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページが置かれるたびに 1 行出す（`GET /api/events`）"
msgstr "Prints one line each time a page is stored (`GET /api/events`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray file list`"
msgstr "`pagetray file list`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "file（画像・PDF・字の file）を絞って探す（`ListFiles`。新しい順）"
msgstr ""
"Finds files (images, PDFs, text files) with filters (`ListFiles`; newest "
"first)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray file view <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray file view <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "file の中身を出す（手の道）。`-o <file>` で file に"
msgstr ""
"Prints the contents of a file (hand-written route). `-o <file>` writes it to "
"a file"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray file put <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray file put <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"file を置く（`CreateFile`）。置いた file の URL と、ページからの参照を出す"
msgstr ""
"Stores a file (`CreateFile`). Prints the URL of the stored file and the "
"reference to use from a page"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray file delete <file>…`"
msgstr "`pagetray file delete <file>…`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "file を消す（`DeleteFiles`。戻せない。`--yes` の時だけ）"
msgstr "Deletes files (`DeleteFiles`; cannot be undone; only with `--yes`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray browse [<project>[/<key>]]`"
msgstr "`pagetray browse [<project>[/<key>]]`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "一覧の UI を browser で開く。`-n` は URL を出すだけ"
msgstr "Opens the list UI in a browser. `-n` only prints the URL"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray backup -o <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray backup -o <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "DB の写し（SQLite の file 1 つ）を取る（`GET /api/backup`。手の道）"
msgstr ""
"Takes a copy of the DB (a single SQLite file) (`GET /api/backup`; hand-"
"written route)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray api <path>`"
msgstr "`pagetray api <path>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"API を直に呼ぶ（手の道）。`-X <method>`・`-f <name>=<value>`・`--input "
"<file>`・`--content-type <type>`"
msgstr ""
"Calls the API directly (hand-written route). `-X <method>`, `-f "
"<name>=<value>`, `--input <file>`, `--content-type <type>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray completion <shell>`"
msgstr "`pagetray completion <shell>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "shell の補完の script を出す（`bash`・`zsh`・`fish` など）"
msgstr "Prints a shell completion script (`bash`, `zsh`, `fish`, and others)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"旗の一覧は、どの命令も `--help` で出る。`<page>` は、ページの URL か、"
"`<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>` の形で書く。`file view`・`file delete` の "
"`<file>` は、file の URL か、`<project>/<key>/files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子>` の形で"
"書く。"
msgstr ""
"Every command lists its flags with `--help`. Write `<page>` as the URL of a "
"page, or in the form `<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>`. For `file view` and `file "
"delete`, write `<file>` as the URL of a file, or in the form `<project>/"
"<key>/files/<stem>-<n>.<ext>`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "# 今いる folder の project の、Key が AI-22 のページ\n"
msgstr "# pages with the Key AI-22 in the project of the current folder\n"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "# 題と本文から探し、名指した欄だけを JSON で\n"
msgstr "# search titles and bodies, and print only the named fields as JSON\n"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "探す（`page list`）"
msgstr "Finding (`page list`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"絞る旗: `--project`・`--key`・`--kind`・`--role`・`--workspace`・`-q`（題と本"
"文の字）・`--reply`（返事の状態。`waiting` は返事待ち、`answered` は答えた物"
"だけ）・`--on`（`--reply` で絞る時の待ちの相手。`pm`＝既定・`review`・"
"`tpm`）・`--verdict`（レビューの判定。`approve`・`concerns`・`reject`・`not-"
"assessed`）。`--oldest` で古い順、`-L` で件数（既定 50。1〜1000 の外は、送る"
"前に code 2）。"
msgstr ""
"Filter flags: `--project`, `--key`, `--kind`, `--role`, `--workspace`, `-q` "
"(text in the title and body), `--reply` (the reply state: `waiting` for "
"pages waiting for a reply only, `answered` for answered pages only), `--on` "
"(the waiting party when filtering with `--reply`: `pm` = default, `review`, "
"`tpm`), `--verdict` (the review verdict: `approve`, `concerns`, `reject`, "
"`not-assessed`). `--oldest` sorts oldest first; `-L` sets the number of "
"results (default 50; outside 1 to 1000 it exits with code 2 before sending)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"続き: 続きがあれば、続きの印を stderr に 1 行で出す（stdout は頼んだ物だ"
"け）。同じ命令に `--next-token <印>` を付けて打つと、次の頁が出る。"
msgstr ""
"More results: when there is more, the token for the rest is printed as one "
"line on stderr (stdout carries only what was asked for). Running the same "
"command with `--next-token <token>` prints the next page."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`--project` が無ければ、どの project のページも出す。`--project .` は、今い"
"る folder の path から project の名を作る（英数字と `._-` のほかを `-` にす"
"る。`roster` と同じ作り方）。"
msgstr ""
"Without `--project`, pages of every project are listed. `--project .` builds "
"the project name from the path of the current folder (every character other "
"than alphanumerics and `._-` becomes `-`; the same way `roster` builds it)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"端末には見出しの付いた表、pipe には tab 区切り（見出しは無い）で出す。欄は、"
"置いた時刻・（project）・Key・種類と番号・役割・返事の状態（`waiting`・"
"`answered`。返事を求めていないページは `-`。Product Manager のほかを待つ物は "
"`waiting:review` のように相手を添える）・URL・題の順。`--json` は、API の"
"「ページの記録」（camelCase。`n` は字。値の無い欄は出さない）に、頼んだ先"
"（`--url`）で組んだ `url` を足した配列。`--json=key,url` のように欄を名指す"
"と、その欄だけを出す（知らない名は code 2）。"
msgstr ""
"On a terminal the output is a table with a header; in a pipe it is tab-"
"separated (without a header). The columns are, in order: the time it was "
"put, (project), Key, kind and number, role, reply state (`waiting` or "
"`answered`; `-` for a page that asks for no reply; for a page waiting on "
"someone other than the Product Manager, the party is added, as in "
"`waiting:review`), URL, title. `--json` prints an array of the API's \"Page "
"record\" (camelCase; `n` is a string; fields without a value are left out) "
"with `url` built from the requested store (`--url`) added. Naming fields, as "
"in `--json=key,url`, prints only those fields (an unknown name is code 2)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置く（`page put`）"
msgstr "Storing (`page put`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`--project`（か環境変数 `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`）・`--key`・`--kind` が要る。"
"project を今いる folder から勝手に決めることは無い（置き間違いを防ぐため）。"
msgstr ""
"`--project` (or the environment variable `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`), `--key`, and "
"`--kind` are required. The project is never decided from the current folder "
"on its own (to prevent storing into the wrong place)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"番号は置き場が決める。同じ project・Key・種類に置き直すと次の番号になり、前の"
"版は残る。"
msgstr ""
"The store decides the number. Storing again to the same project, Key, and "
"kind gets the next number, and the previous version remains."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置く人の役割は `--role`（か `PAGETRAY_ROLE`。既定は `human`）、居場所は `--"
"workspace`。"
msgstr ""
"The role of the person storing is `--role` (or `PAGETRAY_ROLE`; default "
"`human`), and their workspace is `--workspace`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"出す URL は、一覧と同じく、頼んだ先（`--url`）で組む（`file put` も同じ）。"
"`--json` は、ページの記録にその `url` を足した物。"
msgstr ""
"The URL it prints is built from the address it was sent to (`--url`), the "
"same as in the list (also for `file put`). `--json` is the page record with "
"that `url` added."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "返事の状態を書く（`page reply`）"
msgstr "Writing the reply state (`page reply`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"Product Manager の返事が要るページを返事待ちにし（`--waiting`）、答えたら答え"
"たにする（`--answered`）。どちらか 1 つが要る。一覧の UI は、この状態で印と件"
"数を出す（[API の仕様](api.md) の「返事」）。"
msgstr ""
"Marks a page that needs a reply from the Product Manager as waiting (`--"
"waiting`), and as answered once it has been answered (`--answered`). Exactly "
"one of the two is required. The list UI shows its marks and counts from this "
"state (\"Replies\" in the [API specification](api.md))."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "出すのは、状態と URL の 1 行（tab 区切り）。`--json` で、ページの記録。"
msgstr ""
"It prints one line with the state and the URL (tab-separated). `--json` "
"prints the page record."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`--on review|tpm` で、待ちの相手（レビューの席・TPM 担当）を名指す（書かなけ"
"れば Product Manager）。答えたにする時は、その相手を待っているページだけが替"
"わり、違えば何も替えずに code 1（置き場の訳のまま）。"
msgstr ""
"`--on review|tpm` names the waiting party (the review seat or the TPM role; "
"the Product Manager if left out). When marking as answered, only a page "
"waiting on that party changes; otherwise nothing changes and it exits with "
"code 1 (with the store's reason as is)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "無いページ・消したページは code 1。"
msgstr "A missing page or a deleted page is code 1."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`roster` を使う project では、`roster ask pm`・`roster answer`・`roster ask "
"review`・`roster report review`・`roster ask tpm --review` がこの状態を書く。"
"手で直す時だけ使う。"
msgstr ""
"In a project that uses `roster`, `roster ask pm`, `roster answer`, `roster "
"ask review`, `roster report review`, and `roster ask tpm --review` write "
"this state. Use this command only to fix it by hand."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"判定と見た物（[API の仕様](api.md) の「レビューの印」）を書く命令は無い（書く"
"のは roster の命令だけ）。"
msgstr ""
"There is no command that writes the verdict and targets (\"Review marks\" in "
"the [API specification](api.md)); only roster's commands write them."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消す（`page delete`）"
msgstr "Deleting (`page delete`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"戻せない。まず消すページを一覧で出し（`nextToken` を辿って、合う物をみな見"
"る）、**`--yes` を付けた時だけ**消す。`--yes` が無ければ、何も消さずに終わる"
"（終わりの code は 0）。"
msgstr ""
"It cannot be undone. It first lists the pages to delete (following "
"`nextToken` to see every match) and deletes them **only when `--yes` is "
"given**. Without `--yes`, it ends without deleting anything (exit code 0)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"消す先は、命令に書いた物だけ: ページの名指し（いくつでも）か、`--project "
"<name> [--key <key> [--kind <kind>]]`。環境変数の project は、消す先にならな"
"い。"
msgstr ""
"The targets are only what is written on the command line: named pages (any "
"number), or `--project <name> [--key <key> [--kind <kind>]]`. A project in "
"the environment variable never becomes a target."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"いくつかを名指して消す時、途中で断られても、それまでに消した物（`消した（N "
"枚）:` と URL）を stderr に出してから、断られた訳で止まる（消した物は戻せない"
"ため）。"
msgstr ""
"When deleting several named pages, even if refused midway, it prints what "
"was already deleted (the count and the URLs) on stderr, then stops with the "
"refusal's reason (deleted items cannot be restored)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`-` で始まる project の名（`roster` の project の名）は、URL で書くか、`--` "
"の後ろに書く: `pagetray page delete --yes -- -Users-me-x/AI-22/plan-1`。"
msgstr ""
"Write a project name that starts with `-` (the project names of `roster`) as "
"a URL, or after `--`: `pagetray page delete --yes -- -Users-me-x/AI-22/"
"plan-1`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消したページの URL は `410` を返し、同じ番号は 2 度使われない。"
msgstr ""
"The URL of a deleted page returns `410`, and the same number is never used "
"twice."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`**: この環境変数が付いていると（空と `0` のほか）、"
"`page delete`・`file delete` と `api` の `DELETE` は、何もせずに code 1 で止"
"まる。置き場は、だれが消してよいかを見ない。消してよい人を呼ぶ側が決める時"
"に、これを使う（`roster` は、担当を起こす時に付ける）。"
msgstr ""
"**`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`**: When this environment variable is set (to anything "
"other than empty or `0`), `page delete`, `file delete`, and `DELETE` through "
"`api` stop with exit code 1 without doing anything. The store does not check "
"who may delete. Use this when the caller decides who may delete (`roster` "
"sets it when it starts a role)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "新着を待つ（`page watch`）"
msgstr "Waiting for new pages (`page watch`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場の新着の知らせ（`GET /api/events`）のうち、ページを置いた知らせ（event "
"の名の無い物）だけを 1 行ずつ出す。file・返事・印の知らせ（`file`・`reply`・"
"`review`）は出さない。"
msgstr ""
"Of the store's new-arrival notices (`GET /api/events`), prints only those "
"for a stored page (notices without an event name), one line each. Notices "
"for files, replies, and marks (`file`, `reply`, `review`) are not printed."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"流れが途中で切れれば（置き場が落ちた・接続が切れた）code 3、置き場がきれいに"
"閉じれば（止める合図で流れを閉じた）code 0。"
msgstr ""
"If the stream breaks midway (the store went down or the connection dropped), "
"code 3; if the store closes it cleanly (it closes the stream on a stop "
"signal), code 0."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "file（`file list`・`file view`・`file put`・`file delete`）"
msgstr "Files (`file list`, `file view`, `file put`, `file delete`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"file は、ページから参照する画像・PDF・字の file。置ける種類と大きさは [API の"
"仕様](api.md#受ける-file-の種類) の表のとおり（png・jpg・jpeg・gif・webp・"
"pdf・txt・log・md・csv・json。1 つ 16 MiB まで）。"
msgstr ""
"Files are images, PDFs, and text files that pages refer to. The types and "
"size you can store are as in the table in the [API specification]"
"(api.md#accepted-file-types) (png, jpg, jpeg, gif, webp, pdf, txt, log, md, "
"csv, json; up to 16 MiB each)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**探す**（`file list`）: 絞る旗は `--project`・`--key`・`--role`・`--"
"workspace`・`-q`（名 `<語>.<拡張子>` の字）。`--oldest`・`-L`・`--next-"
"token`・`--json` は `page list` と同じ。`--json` は、API の「file の記録」に "
"`url` を足した配列。"
msgstr ""
"**Find** (`file list`): The filter flags are `--project`, `--key`, `--role`, "
"`--workspace`, and `-q` (text in the name `<stem>.<ext>`). `--oldest`, `-L`, "
"`--next-token`, and `--json` work as in `page list`. `--json` prints an "
"array of the API's file records with `url` added."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**読む**（`file view`）: 中身をそのまま stdout に出す。`-o <file>` で file に"
"書く。画像と PDF は、stdout が端末なら出さずに code 2 で止まる（画面が崩れる"
"ため）。`-o` を付けるか、pipe でつなぐ。"
msgstr ""
"**Read** (`file view`): Prints the contents to stdout as stored. `-o <file>` "
"writes them to a file. For images and PDFs, if stdout is a terminal, it "
"prints nothing and stops with exit code 2 (the bytes would garble the "
"screen). Add `-o`, or pipe the output."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**置く**（`file put <file>`）: `--project`（か `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`）と `--"
"key` が要る。役割と居場所は `page put` と同じ。"
msgstr ""
"**Store** (`file put <file>`): `--project` (or `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`) and `--"
"key` are required. The role and workspace work as in `page put`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"名は、file の名から作る: 英小文字にし、英小文字・数字・`-`・`_` のほかが続く"
"所を `-` にし、頭と尻の `-` を除いて 64 字に切る（`Screenshot 2026-11-21 at "
"10.00.png` は `screenshot-2026-11-21-at-10-00.png`。字が残らなければ "
"`file`）。拡張子も英小文字にする。`--name <語>.<拡張子>` で替えられる。"
msgstr ""
"The name is made from the file's name: it is lowercased, each run of "
"characters other than lowercase letters, digits, `-`, and `_` becomes `-`, "
"leading and trailing `-` are removed, and it is cut to 64 characters "
"(`Screenshot 2026-11-21 at 10.00.png` becomes `screenshot-2026-11-21-"
"at-10-00.png`; if nothing is left, `file`). The extension is lowercased too. "
"`--name <stem>.<ext>` sets a different name."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "番号は置き場が決める。同じ名で置き直すと次の番号になり、前の物は残る。"
msgstr ""
"The store decides the number. Storing again with the same name gets the next "
"number, and the previous file remains."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置けると、2 行を出す: file の URL と、同じ Key のページから参照する相対の "
"path（`files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子>`）。ページには `<img src=\"files/"
"screen-1.png\">` のように書く。"
msgstr ""
"When stored, it prints two lines: the URL of the file, and the relative path "
"that a page of the same Key uses to refer to it (`files/<stem>-<n>.<ext>`). "
"In a page, write it like `<img src=\"files/screen-1.png\">`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置く前に、手元で見る（どれかに当たれば、何も送らずに止まる）: 拡張子が置ける"
"種類か・空でないか・16 MiB までか・中身が拡張子の形か（ここまでは code 2）。"
msgstr ""
"Before storing, it checks locally (if any check fails, it sends nothing and "
"stops): the extension is a type that can be stored, the file is not empty, "
"it is at most 16 MiB, and the contents match the extension (these exit with "
"code 2)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**置く前に人が見る**（`file put`）: 置いた file は、置き場を開ける人ならだれ"
"でも読める。"
msgstr ""
"**A person checks before storing** (`file put`): Anyone who can open the "
"store can read a stored file."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"画像と PDF は、**`--reviewed` を付けないと置かない**（code 1）。file を開い"
"て、token・鍵・個人の情報・ほかの人の画面・この Mac の path（home の folder "
"の名など）が写っていないかを確かめてから付ける。"
msgstr ""
"Images and PDFs are **not stored without `--reviewed`** (exit code 1). Open "
"the file and check that no token, key, personal information, other people's "
"screens, or paths on this Mac (such as the name of your home folder) appear "
"in it, then add the flag."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"字の file（txt・log・md・csv・json）は、秘密の形の字を探し、当たれば**置かず"
"に、当たった行の番号を出す**（code 1。当たった字そのものは出さない）。探す形"
"は、GitHub の token（`ghp_`・`gho_`・`ghu_`・`ghs_`・`ghr_`・"
"`github_pat_`）、`sk-` で始まる API の鍵、AWS の access key（`AKIA`）、Slack "
"の token（`xoxb-`・`xoxp-`）、Atlassian の API token（`ATATT`）、秘密の鍵の頭"
"の行（`-----BEGIN … PRIVATE KEY`）。どれも、後ろに token の字が続く物だけ。わ"
"ざと置くなら `--allow-secret` を付ける（置いた上で、当たった行の番号を "
"stderr に出す）。"
msgstr ""
"Text files (txt, log, md, csv, json) are searched for text shaped like "
"secrets. On a match, the file is **not stored, and the matching line numbers "
"are printed** (exit code 1; the matching text itself is not printed). The "
"patterns are GitHub tokens (`ghp_`, `gho_`, `ghu_`, `ghs_`, `ghr_`, "
"`github_pat_`), API keys starting with `sk-`, AWS access keys (`AKIA`), "
"Slack tokens (`xoxb-`, `xoxp-`), Atlassian API tokens (`ATATT`), and the "
"header line of a private key (`-----BEGIN … PRIVATE KEY`). Each counts only "
"when token characters follow. To store it on purpose, add `--allow-secret` "
"(it stores the file and prints the matching line numbers to stderr)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"JPEG に EXIF があれば、止めずに「位置情報が入っているかもしれない」と stderr "
"に出す。消すなら、`exiftool -all= <file>` などで消してから置く。"
msgstr ""
"If a JPEG has EXIF data, it does not stop but prints to stderr that location "
"information may be included. To remove it, strip it with `exiftool -all= "
"<file>` or similar before storing."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**消す**（`file delete`）: `page delete` と同じく、まず消す file を一覧で出"
"し、`--yes` を付けた時だけ消す。消す先は、file の名指し（いくつでも）か、`--"
"project <name> [--key <key> [--name <語>.<拡張子>]]`（`--name` は、その名のど"
"の番号も）。ページを消しても file は消えず、file を消してもページは消えない。"
"`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE` が付いていれば、何もせずに code 1 で止まる。"
msgstr ""
"**Delete** (`file delete`): As with `page delete`, it first lists the files "
"to delete, and deletes only with `--yes`. The target is either files named "
"on the command line (any number) or `--project <name> [--key <key> [--name "
"<stem>.<ext>]]` (`--name` matches every number of that name). Deleting a "
"page does not delete files, and deleting a file does not delete pages. If "
"`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE` is set, it stops with exit code 1 without doing "
"anything."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "DB の写し（`backup`）"
msgstr "Copying the DB (`backup`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"書きかけの `<file>.part-<pid>` に読みながら書き、SQLite の頭を見てから名を付"
"け替える。落ちれば書きかけを消す。止める合図（Ctrl-C の SIGINT・SIGTERM）で止"
"めた時も、書きかけを消してから 130（SIGTERM は 143）で終わる（書きかけには、"
"ページの本文がみな入る）。"
msgstr ""
"It writes to a partial `<file>.part-<pid>` while reading, checks the SQLite "
"header, then renames it; on failure the partial file is removed. When "
"stopped by a stop signal (SIGINT from Ctrl-C, or SIGTERM), the partial file "
"is also removed before exiting with 130 (143 for SIGTERM), because the "
"partial file holds every page body."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"待つのは下の「呼び方」の形。途中で止まった・読めない答えは code 3（置き場が応"
"えない）。"
msgstr ""
"Waiting follows \"How it calls the store\" below. An answer that stalls "
"midway or cannot be read is code 3 (the store does not respond)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "直に呼ぶ（`api`）"
msgstr "Calling directly (`api`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"本文の種類は `--content-type`（既定 `application/json`。返事と印は JSON の本"
"文のため）。ページは `text/html`、file は file の種類を書く。header にできな"
"い値（改行など）は code 2。"
msgstr ""
"The body type is `--content-type` (default `application/json`, because "
"replies and marks take JSON bodies). Give `text/html` for pages and the "
"file's type for files. A value that cannot be a header (a line break, for "
"example) is code 2."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"断られれば、本文を出して code 1（`置き場が 400 ValidationException を返した` "
"など）。知らない道（404 `UnknownOperationException`）も、打ち間違いが多いの"
"で code 4 にせず、ほかの断りと同じく code 1（code 4 にするのは、生成した操作"
"と、CLI が自分で組む手の道だけ。下の「終わりの code」）。"
msgstr ""
"When refused, it prints the body and exits with code 1 (naming the status "
"and the error type, such as `400 ValidationException`). An unknown route "
"(404 `UnknownOperationException`) is usually a typo, so it is not code 4 "
"either: code 1, like any other refusal (code 4 is only for generated "
"operations and the hand-written routes the CLI builds itself; \"Exit codes\" "
"below)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"送り手は、命令からは書かない。`api` で `actorIssuer`・`actorRef` を書くと、"
"castlist に登録の無い送り手なら 400 `ValidationException`（`fieldList` に `/"
"actorRef`）で code 1。"
msgstr ""
"No command writes the sender. If `actorIssuer` and `actorRef` are given "
"through `api` and castlist has no such sender, it exits with code 1 on 400 "
"`ValidationException` (`/actorRef` in `fieldList`)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "旗が環境変数より先、環境変数が既定より先。"
msgstr ""
"Flags take precedence over environment variables, and environment variables "
"over defaults."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "旗"
msgstr "Flag"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "既定"
msgstr "Default"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--url`"
msgstr "`--url`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_URL`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_URL`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`http://127.0.0.1:8801`"
msgstr "`http://127.0.0.1:8801`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置き場の URL（`http://` だけ。`https://` は code 2）"
msgstr "The store URL (`http://` only; `https://` is code 2)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--project`"
msgstr "`--project`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_PROJECT`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_PROJECT`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "無し"
msgstr "none"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`page list`・`page put`・`file list`・`file put` の project"
msgstr "Project for `page list`, `page put`, `file list`, and `file put`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--role`"
msgstr "`--role`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_ROLE`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_ROLE`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`human`"
msgstr "`human`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`page put`・`file put` で置く人の役割"
msgstr "Role of the person storing with `page put` and `file put`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "付いていれば、消す命令を止める"
msgstr "When set, stops the deleting commands"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`BROWSER`"
msgstr "`BROWSER`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "macOS の `open`"
msgstr "`open` on macOS"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "browser を開く命令"
msgstr "Command that opens the browser"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "環境変数の proxy（`HTTP_PROXY` など）は使わない。"
msgstr "Proxy environment variables (such as `HTTP_PROXY`) are not used."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "呼び方"
msgstr "How it calls the store"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"生成した操作（`GetHealth`・`ListPages` などの定義の道）は、定義から作った "
"client（`crates/pagetray-client/`）で呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"Generated operations (the modeled routes such as `GetHealth` and "
"`ListPages`) are called with the client generated from the model (`crates/"
"pagetray-client/`)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"手の道（ページの本文・file の中身・新着の知らせ・DB の写し・`api` の命令）"
"は、生成した client に無いので、同じ HTTP の client（`aws-smithy-http-"
"client` の hyper の作りの connector。`Connector::builder().build_http()`）で"
"直に呼ぶ。ureq は使わない。訳: 生成した client が hyper と tokio を引くので、"
"ureq を足すと HTTP の client が 2 つになり、TLS の無い HTTP/1.1・接続を使い回"
"さない・proxy を使わない・`Host` の決まりを 2 か所で守ることになる。1 つにす"
"れば、決まりは `crates/cli/src/client.rs` の 1 か所で、依存も増えない。"
msgstr ""
"Hand-written routes (page bodies, file contents, new-arrival notices, the DB "
"copy, and the `api` command) are not in the generated client, so they are "
"called directly with the same HTTP client (the hyper-based connector of `aws-"
"smithy-http-client`; `Connector::builder().build_http()`). ureq is not used. "
"Reason: the generated client already pulls in hyper and tokio, so adding "
"ureq would mean two HTTP clients, and the rules (HTTP/1.1 without TLS, no "
"connection reuse, no proxy, the `Host` rule) would have to be kept in two "
"places. With one client, the rules live in one place, `crates/cli/src/"
"client.rs`, and no dependency is added."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"HTTP の設定は、置き場が castlist を呼ぶ時（[API の仕様](api.md) の「送り"
"手」）と同じ: TLS の無い HTTP/1.1（features は `default-client` だけ）・接続"
"を使い回さない（`pool_max_idle_per_host(0)`）・送り直さない"
"（`RetryConfig::disabled()`）・環境変数の proxy を使わない・`Host: 127.0.0.1:"
"<port>`（port は `--url` の物。無ければ付けない）で送り `Origin` は付けない"
"（置き場は `Host` の port を外して 127.0.0.1・localhost でない要求を断る。"
"CLI は browser でないので、つなぐ先の名がどうでも届くようにする。置き場は答え"
"の `url`・`Location` を `Host` で組むので、port を付けて開ける link にす"
"る）。"
msgstr ""
"The HTTP settings are the same as when the store calls castlist (\"Senders\" "
"in the [API specification](api.md)): HTTP/1.1 without TLS (only the `default-"
"client` feature), no connection reuse (`pool_max_idle_per_host(0)`), no "
"retries (`RetryConfig::disabled()`), no proxy from environment variables, "
"and requests are sent with `Host: 127.0.0.1:<port>` (the port from `--url`; "
"none if it has none) and no `Origin` (the store drops the port from `Host` "
"and refuses requests that are not 127.0.0.1 or localhost; the CLI is not a "
"browser, so it should reach the store whatever name it connects to. The "
"store builds the `url` and `Location` of its answers from `Host`, so the "
"port is included to make links that open)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"待つのは 1 度に 10 秒（つなぐ・送る・答えを読み終えるまで）。`page watch` だ"
"けは、答えの頭も本文も待ち続ける。`backup` は、答えの頭まで（置き場が写しを作"
"る間。置き場は 5 秒で 503 を返す）を 10 秒と数え、本文は切れ目ごとに 10 秒"
"（10 秒何も届かなければ、止まった置き場として code 3）で、全部で何秒かかって"
"もよい。訳: 置き場の時間切れも答えの頭までで、送る間は数えない。DB の写しは大"
"きく、読み終えるまでを 10 秒と数えると、大きな DB の写しが取れなくなる。待ち"
"続けると、途中で止まった置き場を待って戻らないので、届かない間だけを数える。"
msgstr ""
"Each call waits up to 10 seconds (connecting, sending, and reading the whole "
"answer). Only `page watch` waits indefinitely for both the head and the body "
"of the answer. `backup` allows 10 seconds until the head of the answer "
"(while the store makes the copy; the store answers 503 after 5 seconds), "
"then 10 seconds per piece of the body (if nothing arrives for 10 seconds, "
"the store is treated as stalled, code 3), with no limit on the total. "
"Reason: the store's timeout also covers only the head and not the sending. A "
"DB copy can be large, and counting 10 seconds until the whole body is read "
"would make large copies impossible. Waiting forever would never return from "
"a store that stalled midway, so only the time with nothing arriving is "
"counted."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "終わりの code"
msgstr "Exit codes"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "code"
msgstr "code"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "訳"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "できた"
msgstr "Success"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場が断った（`4xx`・`5xx`。無いページ `404`・消したページ `410` を含む）。"
"file に書けない時・`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE` で止めた時・`file put` が置く前に止め"
"た時（`--reviewed` が無い・秘密の形がある）も"
msgstr ""
"The store refused (`4xx`, `5xx`; including `404` for a missing page and "
"`410` for a deleted page). Also when a file cannot be written, when "
"`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE` stopped the command, and when `file put` stopped before "
"storing (no `--reviewed`, or a secret pattern was found)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"使い方の誤り（`file put` の、置けない種類・大きすぎる・中身が拡張子と合わな"
"い file を含む）"
msgstr ""
"Usage error (including, for `file put`, a file of a type that cannot be "
"stored, too large, or whose contents do not match its extension)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`3`"
msgstr "`3`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場が応えない（つながらない・10 秒で答えない・答えが読めない・`backup` の"
"本文が 10 秒届かない・`page watch` の流れが途中で切れた）"
msgstr ""
"The store does not respond (cannot connect, no answer within 10 seconds, the "
"answer is unreadable, the `backup` body stops arriving for 10 seconds, or "
"the `page watch` stream breaks midway)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場の API が、この CLI の話す形でない: 生成した操作か、CLI が自分で組む手"
"の道に、生成した層が 404 `UnknownOperationException` を返した（この CLI の呼"
"ぶ操作を知らない、定義より古い置き場）。`api` の命令の道では code 1（上の「直"
"に呼ぶ」）"
msgstr ""
"The store's API is not the shape this CLI speaks: the generated layer "
"returned 404 `UnknownOperationException` to a generated operation or to a "
"hand-written route the CLI builds itself (a store older than the model that "
"does not know the operation this CLI calls). Code 1 on routes of the `api` "
"command (\"Calling directly\" above)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`130`・`143`"
msgstr "`130`, `143`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`backup` を止める合図（SIGINT・SIGTERM）で止めた（書きかけの写しは消した）"
msgstr ""
"`backup` was stopped by a stop signal (SIGINT, SIGTERM); the partial copy "
"was removed"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "誤りの訳は stderr に 1 行で出る。stdout には、頼んだ物だけが出る。"
msgstr ""
"The reason for an error is printed on stderr in one line. Only what you "
"asked for goes to stdout."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"API には版の header が無く、形の版は定義の release の tag との `smithy diff` "
"が守る（[API の仕様](api.md) の「共通の決まり」）。壊す形の替わりは無いので、"
"置き場の版が CLI より古くて困るのは、CLI の呼ぶ操作が置き場に無い時だけ。それ"
"を code 1 の断りとせず、code 4 の「置き場を上げる」と分けて出す。"
msgstr ""
"The API has no version header, and the shape's version is guarded by `smithy "
"diff` against the model's release tag (\"Common rules\" in the [API "
"specification](api.md)). Since there are no breaking changes of shape, a "
"store older than the CLI only causes trouble when it lacks an operation the "
"CLI calls. That case is reported as code 4, \"upgrade the store\", separate "
"from a code 1 refusal."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`roster page` との関わり"
msgstr "Relation to `roster page`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`roster` を使う project では、担当は `roster page`（put・path・list・delete）"
"を使う。`roster page` は、project・Key・役割・控えの folder・消してよい人とい"
"う `roster` の決まりを持ち、同じ API を呼ぶ。`pagetray` は、その決まりを持た"
"ない道具で、`roster` を通さない場面（人の手元・`roster` の project でない "
"folder）で使う。どちらで置いたページも、同じ置き場に入り、どちらからも探せ"
"る。"
msgstr ""
"In a project that uses `roster`, roles use `roster page` (put, path, list, "
"delete). `roster page` carries the rules of `roster` (project, Key, role, "
"the local copy folder, and who may delete) and calls the same API. "
"`pagetray` is a tool without those rules, used where `roster` is not "
"involved (at a person's terminal, or in a folder that is not a `roster` "
"project). Pages stored with either one go into the same store and can be "
"found from both."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"pagetray を呼ぶ側（`roster page`・[CLI](cli.md) の `pagetray` など）が頼って"
"よい形を書く。API は Smithy の定義（`model/model/pagetray.smithy`。名前空間 "
"`ai.pagetray`）から作る。protocol は `aws.protocols#restJson1`。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter describes the shapes that callers of pagetray (`roster page`, "
"the `pagetray` command of the [CLI](cli.md), and so on) may rely on. The API "
"is built from the Smithy model (`model/model/pagetray.smithy`; namespace "
"`ai.pagetray`). The protocol is `aws.protocols#restJson1`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"守るのは、データ（ページと file の行・番号・消した番号）と、そこから決まる振"
"る舞い（番号は 2 度使わない・消したページは 410・本文は置いたままの byte で返"
"す など）と、ページと file の URL の形。"
msgstr ""
"What is kept is the data (the rows of pages and files, their numbers, and "
"the removed numbers), the behavior that follows from it (a number is never "
"used twice, a removed page is 410, a body comes back byte for byte as it was "
"put, and so on), and the shape of the page and file URLs."

#: src/api.md
msgid "共通の決まり"
msgstr "Common rules"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist の API の「[共通の決まり](https://uraitakahito.github.io/castlist/"
"api.html)」と同じ決まりに従う。共通の形（誤り・時刻・ページ送り）は、"
"castlist の定義の `ai.common` を、castlist の release の tag で固めて取る（下"
"の「定義の取り方」）。"
msgstr ""
"pagetray follows the same rules as \"[Common rules](https://"
"uraitakahito.github.io/castlist/api.html)\" in castlist's API. The common "
"shapes (errors, time, paging) are castlist's `ai.common`, fetched and pinned "
"at a castlist release tag (see \"How the model is fetched\" below)."

#: src/api.md src/release.md
msgid "決まり"
msgstr "Rule"

