"API は `/api/` の下。`/healthz` と、ページと file の本文の URL と、画面だけは"
"外"
msgstr ""
"The API lives under `/api/`. Only `/healthz`, the URLs of page and file "
"bodies, and the UI are outside it"

#: src/api.md
