"`aws.protocols#restJson1`。誤りの種類は header `X-Amzn-Errortype` と本文の "
"`message`"
msgstr ""
"`aws.protocols#restJson1`. The kind of an error is in the header `X-Amzn-"
"Errortype`, with `message` in the body"

#: src/api.md
