"`^[1-9][0-9]{0,17}$`）で、答えの `n` も字"
msgstr ""
"An id that goes into a path is a string. The page number `n` is also a "
"string of digits with no leading zero (`\"7\"`; `^[1-9][0-9]{0,17}$`), and "
"`n` in responses is a string too"

