"`waitsOn`・`verdict`・`reply` などは、enum でなく `@pattern` の字で書く"
"（castlist と同じ訳: codegen-server 0.1.40 の作る protocol の試験が、要る "
"enum を空の字から作って落ちる）"
msgstr ""
"`waitsOn`, `verdict`, `reply` and the like are written as `@pattern` "
"strings, not enums (for the same reason as castlist: the protocol tests that "
"codegen-server 0.1.40 generates build a required enum from an empty string "
"and fail)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "知らない欄と引数"
msgstr "Unknown fields and parameters"

#: src/api.md
msgid "restJson1 は読み飛ばす。重ねられない引数を 2 度付ければ初めの物を使う"
msgstr ""
"restJson1 skips them. If a parameter that cannot repeat is given twice, the "
"first one is used"

#: src/api.md
msgid "版"
msgstr "Versions"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"版の header と版だけを返す道は無い。形の版は、service の版（`GET /healthz` "
"の `version`）と、定義の release の tag との `smithy diff`（`ci/gen.sh --"
"diff`。壊す変わりで落ちる）で守る"
msgstr ""
"There is no version header and no route that returns only the version. The "
"shape is versioned by the service version (`version` of `GET /healthz`) and "
"guarded by `smithy diff` against the model at the release tag (`ci/gen.sh --"
"diff`; it fails on breaking changes)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"呼ぶ側は、知らない欄を読み飛ばし、`message` の文で分けないこと（誤りは状態の"
"数と `X-Amzn-Errortype` で見分ける）。"
msgstr ""
"Callers must skip fields they do not know and must not branch on the text of "
"`message` (tell errors apart by the status code and `X-Amzn-Errortype`)."

