"`GET /api/files`（引数 `project`・`key`・`role`・`workspace`・`q`・`actor`・"
"`sort`・`maxResults`・`nextToken`）"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/files` (parameters `project`, `key`, `role`, `workspace`, `q`, "
"`actor`, `sort`, `maxResults`, `nextToken`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DeleteFiles`"
msgstr "`DeleteFiles`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/files?project&key&name&n`"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/files?project&key&name&n`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"手の道（Smithy の外）: ページの本文 `GET /{project}/{key}/{kind}-{n}.html`・"
"file の中身 `GET /{project}/{key}/files/{語}-{n}.{拡張子}`・新着の知らせ "
"`GET /api/events`（SSE）・`GET /api/backup`・`GET /api/logs`・画面（`/`・`/"
"{project}/`・`/{project}/{key}/`）。"
msgstr ""
"Hand-written routes (outside Smithy): page bodies `GET /{project}/{key}/"
"{kind}-{n}.html`, file contents `GET /{project}/{key}/files/{word}-{n}."
"{extension}`, new-arrival notices `GET /api/events` (SSE), `GET /api/"
"backup`, `GET /api/logs`, and the UI (`/`, `/{project}/`, `/{project}/{key}/"
"`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置かれたページの URL は切らない。だから本文の URL は Smithy の外の手の道にす"
"る（`.html` の付いた 1 段は、Smithy の道の label にできない）。"
msgstr ""
"The URLs of pages already put must not break. So the body URLs are hand-"
"written routes outside Smithy (a path segment ending in `.html` cannot be a "
"Smithy label)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`/api/` の下の道は、みな生成した層か、名指した手の道に行く。本文の道（`/"
"{project}/{key}/{file}`）は `/api/…` を受けない（`project` に `api` は置けな"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"Every path under `/api/` goes to the generated layer or to a named hand-"
"written route. The body route (`/{project}/{key}/{file}`) does not take `/"
"api/…` (no page can have the `project` `api`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/backup`（`crates/server/src/hand.rs`）: DB の隣の一時の file"
"（`<DB>.backup-<pid>-<番号>`）に `VACUUM INTO` で揃ったバックアップを作り、開"
"いてから名を消し（作る・開く・名を消すは別の task でするので、写しを作る間に"
"時間切れで 503 を返しても、client が切っても、一時の file は残らない。止める"
"合図で、写しを作る途中に process が終わった時だけは残り得る）、`application/"
"vnd.sqlite3`（`Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"pages.db\"`）で読"
"みながら送る。読む接続で作る（写しを作る間、書く物を待たせない）。誤りは "
"restJson1 の形の 503 `Unavailable`・500 `InternalError`。時間切れは答えの頭ま"
"で（写しを作る間）を数え、送る間は数えない（下の「守りの層」）。写しを作るの"
"に 5 秒を過ぎれば 503 `Unavailable`。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/backup` (`crates/server/src/hand.rs`): it makes a consistent "
"backup with `VACUUM INTO` in a temporary file next to the DB (`<DB>.backup-"
"<pid>-<seq>`), opens it, removes the name (making, opening and removing the "
"name run in a separate task, so the temporary file is not left behind even "
"when the timeout answers 503 while the copy is being made, or the client "
"hangs up; it can be left behind only when the process ends on a stop signal "
"in the middle of making the copy), and streams it as `application/"
"vnd.sqlite3` (`Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"pages.db\"`). It "
"is made on a read connection (writers are not kept waiting while the copy is "
"made). Errors are a 503 `Unavailable` or a 500 `InternalError` in the "
"restJson1 shape. The timeout counts up to the response head (while the copy "
"is made), not the time spent sending (see \"Guard layer\" below). If making "
"the copy takes more than 5 seconds, the answer is a 503 `Unavailable`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/logs`: `text/plain; charset=utf-8` で、終わり方の印と、古い順の記録"
"（中身の形は [動かす](run.md) の「落ちた後に調べる」。行の形は仕様に入らな"
"い）。記録の置き場が無い時（Router を直に呼ぶ試験）は 404（形は restJson1 の "
"`NotFound`）。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/logs`: `text/plain; charset=utf-8`, with the run marks and the log "
"lines oldest first (the format is in \"Investigating after a crash\" in "
"[Running](run.md); the line format is not part of the specification). "
"Without a log place (tests that call the Router directly), it is a 404 (in "
"the restJson1 `NotFound` shape)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページを置く（CreatePage）"
msgstr "Putting a page (CreatePage)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "欄・引数"
msgstr "Field or parameter"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`project`・`key`（道）"
msgstr "`project`, `key` (path)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"英数字と `.` `_` `-` で 1〜255 字。`.` と `..` は 400（server）。`project` "
"に `api` は 400（server）"
msgstr ""
"Alphanumerics and `.` `_` `-`, 1 to 255 characters. `.` and `..` are 400 "
"(server). `api` as `project` is 400 (server)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`kind`（道）・`role`（引数。要る）"
msgstr "`kind` (path), `role` (parameter; required)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"英小文字で始まり、英小文字・数字・`-` で 1〜32 字。名の一覧は server が持たな"
"い（呼ぶ側が決める）"
msgstr ""
"1–32 characters of lowercase letters, digits, and `-`, starting with a "
"lowercase letter. The server keeps no list of names (callers decide)"

#: src/api.md src/db.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`workspace`"
msgstr "`workspace`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "英数字と `:` `.` `_` `-` で 0〜64 字。無ければ空"
msgstr ""
"Alphanumerics and `:` `.` `_` `-`, 0 to 64 characters. Empty if not given"

#: src/api.md src/db.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`n`"
msgstr "`n`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "取り込みの時だけ。数の字（`0`・`01`・`abc` は 400）"
msgstr "Only for imports. A string of digits (`0`, `01`, `abc` are 400)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`createdAt`"
msgstr "`createdAt`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"取り込みの時だけ。UTC の RFC 3339。ミリ秒より細かい時刻は 400（切って残すと、"
"取り込んだ時刻が替わる）。0001 年から 9999 年まで（0000 年は答えの時刻に書け"
"ないので、生成した層が 400）"
msgstr ""
"Only for imports. RFC 3339 in UTC. A time finer than a millisecond is 400 "
"(truncating it would change the imported time). Years 0001 to 9999 (the year "
"0000 cannot be written in a response time, so the generated layer returns "
"400)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`actorIssuer`・`actorRef`"
msgstr "`actorIssuer`, `actorRef`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手の付随する id。両方書くか、両方書かない（片方だけは 400）。"
"`actorIssuer` は英小文字・数字・`-`・`.` で 1〜64 字、`actorRef` の形は "
"`ai.common#ActorRef`（castlist と同じ。`種類:値` で、値は制御字の無い 1〜256 "
"字。空白や `/` も通る）。castlist に聞く所は下の「送り手」"
msgstr ""
"The sender's attached id. Give both or neither (only one is 400). "
"`actorIssuer` is 1 to 64 lowercase letters, digits, `-`, and `.`; `actorRef` "
"has the shape `ai.common#ActorRef` (same as castlist: `kind:value`, where "
"the value is 1 to 256 characters without control characters; spaces and `/` "
"pass). How castlist is asked is under \"Senders\" below"

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文"
msgstr "Body"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`Content-Type: text/html`（`; charset=…` は付いてよい）。ほかの種類と、"
"`Content-Type` の無い要求は、生成した層が 415 "
"`UnsupportedMediaTypeException`。空の本文は、生成した層が 400 "
"`ValidationException` で断る（欄の path は `/body`）。UTF-8 でなくても受ける"
"（題と検索の字は、読めない byte を置き換えて取る）"
msgstr ""
"`Content-Type: text/html` (`; charset=…` may follow). Another type, or a "
"request without `Content-Type`, gets 415 `UnsupportedMediaTypeException` "
"from the generated layer. An empty body is refused by the generated layer "
"with 400 `ValidationException` (the field path is `/body`). A body that is "
"not UTF-8 is accepted (the title and the search text are taken with "
"unreadable bytes replaced)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"番号: 書かなければ、同じ `project`・`key`・`kind` の置いた番号と消した番号の"
"最大 + 1（初めは 1）。書く接続は 1 本なので、並べて置いても重ならず抜けない。"
"書けばその番号で置き、置いた番号・消した番号なら 409 `Conflict`（何も替えな"
"い）。次に任せた番号は、取り込んだ番号の次になる。"
msgstr ""
"Number: if not given, the largest put or removed number for the same "
"`project`, `key`, and `kind`, plus 1 (1 at first). There is a single write "
"connection, so parallel puts neither collide nor leave gaps. If given, the "
"page is put with that number, and a number already put or removed is 409 "
"`Conflict` (nothing changes). The next number left to the server comes after "
"the imported one."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"答えは 201 で、ページの記録（本文は入らない）と、要求の `Host` で組んだ `url`"
"（header `Location` にも）。置いた時は、返事・判定・見た物の欄は無い。送り手"
"の欄（`sender`）は、付随する id を書いた時だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The response is 201 with the page record (without the body) and a `url` "
"built from the request's `Host` (also in the `Location` header). Right after "
"a put there are no reply, verdict, or target fields. The sender field "
"(`sender`) is present only when the attached id was given."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"検査の順: 引数の形（400）→ 付随する id の組（400）→ castlist（400・503）→ DB"
"（409・503）。前で断れば、後は見ない（castlist に聞かない・何も残さない）。"
msgstr ""
"Order of checks: parameter shapes (400) → the attached id pair (400) → "
"castlist (400, 503) → DB (409, 503). A refusal at an earlier step skips the "
"later ones (castlist is not asked and nothing is stored)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"題は大小を問わない初めの `<title>` の中身（文字参照を戻し、空白を 1 つにまと"
"める。無ければ空）。検索の索引には、題と、tag・script・style・comment を除い"
"て文字参照を 1 度戻した字を入れる（`crates/server/src/text.rs`）。"
msgstr ""
"The title is the contents of the first `<title>`, in any case (character "
"references decoded, white space collapsed to one; empty if missing). The "
"search index gets the title and the text with tags, scripts, styles, and "
"comments removed and character references decoded once (`crates/server/src/"
"text.rs`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"混んでいて書く接続を 2 秒（`WRITE_WAIT`）待っても取れなければ 503 "
"`Unavailable`（問い合わせの時間切れ 5 秒より前に答える）。"
msgstr ""
"If the store is busy and the write connection cannot be taken within 2 "
"seconds (`WRITE_WAIT`), the response is 503 `Unavailable` (it answers before "
"the 5-second request timeout)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文は 16 MiB まで（超えれば、守りの層が 413 `PayloadTooLarge`。下の「守りの"
"層」）。"
msgstr ""
"The body is up to 16 MiB (beyond that, the guard layer answers 413 "
"`PayloadTooLarge`; see \"Guard layer\" below)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "送り手"
msgstr "Senders"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"付随する id（`actorIssuer`・`actorRef`）を書いて置けば、[castlist]"
"(glossary.md)（アクターの本当の id と名を持つ、pagetray を動かす機械の別の "
"container のサーバー）に送り手を聞き、答えと一緒に残す。後から castlist の答"
"えが変わっても、残した物は変えない。"
msgstr ""
"When a page is put with an attached id (`actorIssuer`, `actorRef`), the "
"store asks [castlist](glossary.md) (a server in another container on the "
"machine that runs pagetray, holding the true id and name of each actor) for "
"the sender and records the answer with it. Even if castlist's answer changes "
"later, what was recorded is not changed."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist の居場所は `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`（聞く先）。`http://<host>:"
"<port>` の形だけ（後ろの `/` はよい。path・利用者の名・`https://`・port の無"
"い物・port 0 は、起きる前に断る）。空か無ければ castlist は無い。画面の link "
"の頭 `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` は別に決め（container の中から届く所と、"
"host の browser から開く所は違う）、形は同じ、無いか空なら `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8802`。形の違う link は、castlist の URL が無くても断る。起こす "
"binary（`pagetray-server`。下の「起こし方」）が、DB を開く前に "
"`Castlist::from_env` で見て、形が違えば止まる。link を使うのは画面の送り手の"
"名（下の「画面」）。"
msgstr ""
"castlist's location is `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` (where to ask). Only the "
"shape `http://<host>:<port>` is accepted (a trailing `/` is fine; a path, a "
"user name, `https://`, a missing port, or port 0 is refused before "
"starting). If it is empty or absent, there is no castlist. The link base for "
"the screens, `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`, is set separately (what is "
"reachable from inside the container differs from what the host's browser "
"opens), with the same shape, and defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:8802` when "
"absent or empty. A link in the wrong shape is refused even without a "
"castlist URL. The startup binary (`pagetray-server`; see \"Starting it\" "
"below) checks them with `Castlist::from_env` before opening the DB and stops "
"if a shape is wrong. The link is used for the sender's name on the screens "
"(see \"Screens\" below)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"聞くのは `ResolveActors`（`POST /api/resolve`、本文 `{\"issuer\":…,\"refs\":"
"[…]}`）を 1 度。castlist の定義から作った client（`crates/castlist-client/`）"
"で呼ぶ。書く取引を始める前に聞く（castlist を待つ間、書く接続を握らない）。"
msgstr ""
"pagetray calls `ResolveActors` (`POST /api/resolve`, body `{\"issuer\":…,"
"\"refs\":[…]}`) once, with the client generated from castlist's model "
"(`crates/castlist-client/`). It asks before starting the write transaction "
"(the write connection is not held while waiting for castlist)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"HTTP の client は、`aws-smithy-http-client` の hyper の作りの、TLS の無い "
"HTTP/1.1（`Builder::new().build_http()`。features は `default-client` だけ。"
"`default-client` は証明書を読む crate（`rustls-native-certs`・`rustls-pki-"
"types`）を引くが、TLS の実装（rustls・aws-lc・ring・s2n）は入らない）。接続は"
"使い回さない（`pool_max_idle_per_host(0)`。1 度ごとにつなぐので、castlist が"
"閉じた古い接続で落ちることがない）。"
msgstr ""
"The HTTP client is the hyper-based, TLS-less HTTP/1.1 client of `aws-smithy-"
"http-client` (`Builder::new().build_http()`; only the `default-client` "
"feature. `default-client` pulls in crates that read certificates (`rustls-"
"native-certs`, `rustls-pki-types`), but no TLS implementation (rustls, aws-"
"lc, ring, s2n)). Connections are not reused (`pool_max_idle_per_host(0)`; "
"each call opens a new connection, so a stale connection that castlist closed "
"cannot make a call fail)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"待つのは 1 度に 1 秒（つなぐ・送る・答えを読み終えるまでの全部。client の "
"`operation_timeout`）。送り直さない（`RetryConfig::disabled()`。castlist の "
"`Unavailable` は `@retryable` だが、送り直すかは pagetray の呼び手が決め"
"る）。"
msgstr ""
"Each call waits at most 1 second (connecting, sending, and reading the whole "
"answer; the client's `operation_timeout`). There are no retries "
"(`RetryConfig::disabled()`; castlist's `Unavailable` is `@retryable`, but "
"whether to resend is up to pagetray's caller)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist は `Host` が 127.0.0.1・localhost でない要求と、`Origin` の付いた書"
"く要求を断るので、つなぐ先がどこでも `Host: 127.0.0.1` で送り、`Origin` は付"
"けない。"
msgstr ""
"castlist refuses requests whose `Host` is not 127.0.0.1 or localhost and "
"write requests with an `Origin`, so pagetray always sends `Host: 127.0.0.1`, "
"wherever it connects, and never sends `Origin`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"答えの見方: 聞いた `ref` の答えが無い・`asOf` が無い（生成した client は、答"
"えに無い `@required` の欄を既定の値で埋めるので、1970 年の初めの時刻は無い物"
"とする）・アクターの `id` が `ai.common#ActorId` の形でない（画面の link の "
"path に入る）・`kind` が `ai`・`human` でない・`name` が 1〜128 字でないか制"
"御字を持つ、のどれかなら読めない答えとする。答えの大きさの上限は持たず、1 秒"
"の時間切れに任せる。"
msgstr ""
"Checking the answer: it is treated as unreadable if there is no result for "
"the asked `ref`, `asOf` is missing (the generated client fills missing "
"`@required` fields with default values, so the start of 1970 is treated as "
"missing), the actor's `id` is not in the `ai.common#ActorId` shape (it goes "
"into the path of the screen link), `kind` is not `ai` or `human`, or `name` "
"is not 1 to 128 characters or has control characters. There is no limit on "
"the answer size; the 1-second timeout bounds it instead."

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist の答え"
msgstr "castlist's answer"

#: src/api.md
msgid "pagetray の答え"
msgstr "pagetray's response"

#: src/api.md
msgid "残す物"
msgstr "What is stored"

#: src/api.md
msgid "送り手を知っている"
msgstr "Knows the sender"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"201。`sender` に `issuer`・`ref`・`actor`（`id`・`name`・`kind`）・"
"`resolvedAt`（答えの `asOf`）"
msgstr ""
"201. `sender` has `issuer`, `ref`, `actor` (`id`, `name`, `kind`), and "
"`resolvedAt` (the answer's `asOf`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページと、送り手の行（答えた時刻は残す字の 24 字）"
msgstr ""
"The page and a sender row (the answer time in the stored 24-character form)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "送り手を知らない（`actor` が無い）"
msgstr "Does not know the sender (no `actor`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"400 `ValidationException`（`message` は「castlist に登録の無い送り手（…）」、"
"`fieldList` の path は `/actorRef`）"
msgstr ""
"400 `ValidationException` (`message` says the sender is not registered in "
"castlist; the `fieldList` path is `/actorRef`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "何も残さない"
msgstr "Nothing"

#: src/api.md
msgid "つながらない・1 秒で答えない・2xx でない・読めない"
msgstr "Cannot connect, no answer within 1 second, not 2xx, or unreadable"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"503 `Unavailable`（`message` は「castlist に聞けない（訳）。…」。訳は記録にも"
"書く。記録の訳も答えと同じ粗い字（`castlist: つながらない ref=…`）で、つなぎ"
"の誤りの細かい字（hyper の誤り）は書かない）"
msgstr ""
"503 `Unavailable` (`message` says that castlist could not be asked, with the "
"reason; the reason is also written to the log. The log reason is as coarse "
"as the answer (`castlist: <reason> ref=…`); the detailed connection error "
"(the hyper error) is not written)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist が無い（`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` が空）"
msgstr "No castlist (`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` is empty)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "201。`sender` は `issuer`・`ref` だけ"
msgstr "201. `sender` has only `issuer` and `ref`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページと、答えの欄の空の送り手の行"
msgstr "The page and a sender row with empty answer columns"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"呼び手は、`fieldList` に `/actorRef` のある 400 を「castlist に登録が無い送り"
"手（session が castlist に登録されてから打ち直す）」と見分ける。503 は、少し"
"待ってから送り直す。"
msgstr ""
"Callers tell a 400 with `/actorRef` in `fieldList` apart as \"a sender not "
"registered in castlist (resend once the session is registered in castlist)"
"\". On a 503, wait a little and resend."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"知らない送り手を 400 にするのは、castlist の `PutEvent` が、引けない `by` を "
"400 `ValidationException` にするのと同じにするため（誤りの型を増やさない）。"
msgstr ""
"An unknown sender is 400 to match castlist's `PutEvent`, which answers an "
"unresolvable `by` with 400 `ValidationException` (no new error type is "
"added)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手の行は足すだけ（trigger が書き換えと消すのを断る）で、置くたびに 1 行"
"（同じ送り手でもまとめない）。ページと同じ取引で足すので、番号が使われていて "
"409 なら、送り手の行も残らない。"
msgstr ""
"Sender rows are append-only (triggers refuse updates and deletes), one row "
"per put (the same sender is not merged). The row is added in the same "
"transaction as the page, so when the number is taken and the answer is 409, "
"no sender row remains either."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`sender` は `ai.pagetray#Sender`（`actor` は castlist と同じ "
"`ai.common#ActorSummary`）。server の骨は、答えにだけ使う形の決まり"
"（`ActorSummary` の `id`・`kind` の `@pattern`）にも使わない検査の関数を作る"
"ので、`ci/gen.sh` が骨の `lib.rs` の頭に `#![allow(dead_code)]` を足す。"
msgstr ""
"`sender` is `ai.pagetray#Sender` (`actor` is `ai.common#ActorSummary`, the "
"same as castlist). The server skeleton generates unused validation functions "
"even for constraints used only in responses (the `@pattern` of "
"`ActorSummary`'s `id` and `kind`), so `ci/gen.sh` adds `#!"
"[allow(dead_code)]` at the top of the skeleton's `lib.rs`."

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページの記録"
msgstr "Page record"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`ListPages` の行と、`SetReplyState`・`AddReviewMarks` の答えは、同じページの"
"記録（`ai.pagetray#Page`。本文と `url` は入らない）。`CreatePage` の答えの欄"
"（`url`・`Location` のほか）に、返事と印の欄（`PageState`）を足した物。"
msgstr ""
"The rows of `ListPages` and the answers of `SetReplyState` and "
"`AddReviewMarks` are the same page record (`ai.pagetray#Page`; no body and "
"no `url`). It is the fields of the `CreatePage` answer (other than `url` and "
"`Location`) plus the reply and mark fields (`PageState`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`askedAt`（返事待ちにした時刻）・`answeredAt`（答えた時刻）・`waitsOn`"
"（`review`・`tpm`）・`verdict`・`targets`（書いた順）・`sender` は、値のある"
"時だけ。Product Manager を待つページに `waitsOn` は無い（DB でも空）。"
msgstr ""
"`askedAt` (when a reply was asked for), `answeredAt` (when it was answered), "
"`waitsOn` (`review`, `tpm`), `verdict`, `targets` (in the order written), "
"and `sender` appear only when they have a value. A page waiting for the "
"Product Manager has no `waitsOn` (it is empty in the DB too)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手は、castlist の答えがあれば `actor` と `resolvedAt` も。castlist の無"
"い pagetray が置いたページは `issuer`・`ref` だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The sender also has `actor` and `resolvedAt` when castlist answered. A page "
"put by a pagetray without castlist has only `issuer` and `ref`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`path` は、この server の中の path（`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`）。"
"`<server の URL><path>` で本文が開く。"
msgstr ""
"`path` is a path within this server (`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`). "
"`<server URL><path>` opens the body."

#: src/api.md
msgid "探す（ListPages）"
msgstr "Searching (ListPages)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "引数"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`"
msgstr "`project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"同じ値の物。形は置く時と同じ（違えば 400）。`workspace=`（空）も条件で、"
"workspace を書かずに置いたページに当たる"
msgstr ""
"Pages with the same value. The shapes are the same as when putting "
"(otherwise 400). `workspace=` (empty) is also a condition and matches pages "
"put without a workspace"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`q`"
msgstr "`q`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"前後の空白を落とし、空なら絞らない。どの語も 3 字以上なら、語ごとに引用符で囲"
"んだ trigram の全文検索（どの語も含む物。大小を問わない。`\"`・`*`・`AND` な"
"どはただの字）。3 字に満たない語があれば、`q` 全体を題と本文の字で探す"
"（`instr`。大小を分ける）"
msgstr ""
"Surrounding spaces are dropped; if empty, it does not narrow. If every term "
"has 3 or more characters, each term becomes a quoted trigram full-text "
"phrase (pages containing every term; case-insensitive; `\"`, `*`, `AND` and "
"the like are plain characters). If any term is shorter than 3 characters, "
"the whole `q` is searched in the title and text (`instr`; case-sensitive)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`reply`・`on`"
msgstr "`reply`, `on`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`reply` は `waiting`（求めて、まだ答えていない）か `answered`（答えた）。"
"`on` はその待ちの相手（`pm`・`review`・`tpm`。既定 `pm`）。`reply` の無い "
"`on` は 400"
msgstr ""
"`reply` is `waiting` (asked for and not answered yet) or `answered` "
"(answered). `on` is the party waited on (`pm`, `review`, `tpm`; default "
"`pm`). `on` without `reply` is 400"

#: src/api.md src/db.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`verdict`"
msgstr "`verdict`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`approve`・`concerns`・`reject`・`not-assessed`"
msgstr "`approve`, `concerns`, `reject`, `not-assessed`"

#: src/api.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`actor`"
msgstr "`actor`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手の castlist のアクターの id（`ai.common#ActorId` の形）。castlist の答"
"えの無い送り手のページには当たらない"
msgstr ""
"The castlist actor id of the sender (the shape of `ai.common#ActorId`). "
"Pages whose sender has no castlist answer do not match"

#: src/api.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`sort`"
msgstr "`sort`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`-createdAt`（新しい順。既定）か `createdAt`（古い順）。同じ時刻は置いた順"
"（新しい順なら、後に置いた物が先）"
msgstr ""
"`-createdAt` (newest first; default) or `createdAt` (oldest first). Equal "
"times follow the order they were put (newest first puts the later one first)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`maxResults`・`nextToken`"
msgstr "`maxResults`, `nextToken`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "1 頁は既定 100。1〜1000 の外は、生成した層が 400"
msgstr ""
"A page holds 100 by default. Outside 1 to 1000, the generated layer answers "
"400"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"頁は keyset で続ける: `nextToken` は、検索の種類（`pages`）・`sort`・前の頁の"
"最後の行の `createdAt`（残す字）と id を繋いで 16 進にした物（castlist の頁の"
"印と同じ形）。同じ時刻の行が頁の境に並んでも、抜けず重ならない。辿る間に置い"
"たページ（前の頁より新しい）は、新しい順の続きに出ない。"
msgstr ""
"Pages continue by keyset: `nextToken` is the search kind (`pages`), `sort`, "
"and the `createdAt` (stored string) and id of the last row of the previous "
"page, joined and hex-encoded (the same shape as castlist's page token). Rows "
"with the same time on a page boundary are neither skipped nor repeated. "
"Pages put while walking (newer than the previous page) do not appear in the "
"rest of a newest-first walk."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`nextToken` は同じ `sort` の答えの物を渡す。崩れた物・ほかの検索の物・`sort` "
"の違う物は 400 `ValidationException`（`message` に `nextToken`）。ほかの条件"
"は印に結ばない（castlist の `ListActors` と同じ）。"
msgstr ""
"Pass a `nextToken` from an answer with the same `sort`. A broken one, one "
"from another search, or one with a different `sort` is 400 "
"`ValidationException` (`message` mentions `nextToken`). Other conditions are "
"not bound to the token (the same as castlist's `ListActors`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "続きは `nextToken` だけ（時刻の字で切る引数は無い）。"
msgstr ""
"Continuing is only through `nextToken` (there is no parameter that cuts by "
"time text)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"読む接続の 1 つの取引で、1 頁より 1 つ多く読み、次の頁があるかを決める。読む"
"接続を 3 秒（`READ_WAIT`）待っても取れなければ 503 `Unavailable`、DB の誤り"
"は 500 `InternalError`。"
msgstr ""
"One read transaction reads one more row than a page to decide whether there "
"is a next page. If no read connection is free after 3 seconds (`READ_WAIT`), "
"it is 503 `Unavailable`; a DB error is 500 `InternalError`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"SQL は、書いた条件の欠片だけを繋ぐ（`crates/server/src/search.rs`。値は bind "
"する）。`explain query plan` の試験（`crates/server/tests/list.rs`）が、"
"pages を索引なしに端から読まないこと、project・key・送り手・返事待ち・"
"`nextToken` の条件は索引で引くこと、条件の無い一覧と `nextToken` は時刻の索引"
"の順に読む（並べ替えの一時の表を作らない）ことを見る。返事待ちは、返事待ちだ"
"けの部分の索引（`pages_waiting`）から引く（条件をじかに書くと、planner は時刻"
"の索引の順に端から読む方を選ぶ）。短い語の検索は、索引の表を端から見る。"
msgstr ""
"The SQL joins only the pieces of the conditions given (`crates/server/src/"
"search.rs`; values are bound). An `explain query plan` test (`crates/server/"
"tests/list.rs`) checks that pages are never read end to end without an "
"index, that the project, key, sender, waiting, and `nextToken` conditions "
"look rows up through an index, and that the unfiltered list and `nextToken` "
"read in the order of the time index (no temporary table for sorting). "
"Waiting pages are looked up from the partial index of waiting pages only "
"(`pages_waiting`) (written as plain conditions, the planner chooses to read "
"in the order of the time index from the end). A search with short terms "
"reads the index table end to end."

#: src/api.md
msgid "返事（SetReplyState）"
msgstr "Replies (SetReplyState)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページ 1 枚の返事の状態を書く。`roster ask pm` が返事待ちにし、`roster "
"answer` が答えたにする。一覧の UI は、この状態で印と件数を出す。本文は JSON "
"の `{\"state\":\"waiting\"|\"answered\",\"on\":\"pm\"|\"review\"|\"tpm\"}`"
"（`on` は無ければ `pm`）。答えは 200 で、書いた後のページの記録。"
msgstr ""
"Writes the reply state of one page. `roster ask pm` marks it waiting, and "
"`roster answer` marks it answered. The list UI shows its marks and counts "
"from this state. The body is the JSON `{\"state\":\"waiting\"|\"answered\","
"\"on\":\"pm\"|\"review\"|\"tpm\"}` (`on` defaults to `pm`). The answer is "
"200 with the page record after writing."

#: src/api.md
msgid "今のページ"
msgstr "Current page"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`waiting`（`on` の相手）"
msgstr "`waiting` (party `on`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`answered`（`on` の相手）"
msgstr "`answered` (party `on`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "返事を求めていない"
msgstr "No reply asked for"

#: src/api.md
msgid "求めた時刻を今にし、待ちの相手を `on` に"
msgstr "Set the asked time to now and the waited-on party to `on`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`pm` なら、求めた時刻と答えた時刻に同じ今を入れる。ほかの相手は 409"
msgstr ""
"For `pm`, set both the asked and the answered time to the same now. Other "
"parties are 409"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`on` の相手を待っている"
msgstr "Waiting for the `on` party"

#: src/api.md
msgid "何も替えない（時刻は初めの物）"
msgstr "Change nothing (the first time stays)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "答えた時刻を今に（待ちの相手は替えない）"
msgstr "Set the answer time to now (the waited-on party stays)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ほかの相手を待っている"
msgstr "Waiting for another party"

#: src/api.md
msgid "409（待ちを黙って移さない）"
msgstr "409 (a wait is not moved silently)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "409"
msgstr "409"

#: src/api.md
msgid "答えた（相手が `on`）"
msgstr "Answered (party is `on`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "求めた時刻を今にし、答えた時刻を消す"
msgstr "Set the asked time to now and clear the answered time"

#: src/api.md
msgid "何も替えない（答えた時刻を保つ）"
msgstr "Change nothing (the answered time stays)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "答えた（相手が `on` でない）"
msgstr "Answered (party is not `on`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"求めた時刻を今にし、答えた時刻を消し、待ちの相手を `on` に（求め直しは相手を"
"替えてよい）"
msgstr ""
"Set the asked time to now, clear the answered time, and set the waited-on "
"party to `on` (asking again may change the party)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"409 `Conflict` は何も替えない（`message` は「そのページは、on の相手の返事を"
"待っていない（何も替えていない）」）。"
msgstr ""
"409 `Conflict` changes nothing (the `message` says the page is not waiting "
"for the reply of the `on` party and nothing was changed)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"無いページも、消したページも 404 `NotFound`（410 でない）。`project`・`key` "
"の `.`・`..` は 400。`state` の無い本文・JSON でない本文は 400。"
msgstr ""
"Both a missing page and a removed page are 404 `NotFound` (not 410). `.` and "
"`..` as `project` or `key` are 400. A body without `state` and a body that "
"is not JSON are 400."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"見る・書く・答えの記録を読むは、書く接続の 1 つの取引。書く接続を 2 秒待って"
"も取れなければ 503、DB の誤りは 500（どちらも何も替えない）。時刻は残す字"
"（24 字）。"
msgstr ""
"Checking, writing, and reading the answer record happen in one transaction "
"on the write connection. If the write connection is not free after 2 "
"seconds, it is 503; a DB error is 500 (neither changes anything). Times are "
"the stored string (24 characters)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"だれが書いてよいかは、呼ぶ側（roster）が持つ。browser の中のページからは書け"
"ない（守りの層が `Origin` の付いた要求を 403）。"
msgstr ""
"Who may write is decided by the caller (roster). A page inside a browser "
"cannot write (the guard layer answers 403 to requests with an `Origin`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "レビューの印（AddReviewMarks）"
msgstr "Review marks (AddReviewMarks)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページ 1 枚に、判定と見た物を書く（`roster ask review`・`roster report "
"review` が書く）。本文は JSON の `{\"verdict\":…,\"targets\":[…]}`（どちらも"
"書かなくてよく、本文が無くてもよい。何も書かなければ、何も替えずに記録を返"
"す）。答えは 200 で、書いた後のページの記録。"
msgstr ""
"Writes a verdict and reviewed targets on one page (`roster ask review` and "
"`roster report review` write them). The body is the JSON `{\"verdict\":…,"
"\"targets\":[…]}` (both are optional, and the body may be missing; with "
"nothing written, it changes nothing and returns the record). The answer is "
"200 with the page record after writing."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`verdict` は、書けば替わり、書かなければ前のまま（消す道は無い）。種類が "
"`review` のページだけ（ほかは 400）。"
msgstr ""
"`verdict` changes when written and stays when not (there is no way to clear "
"it). Only pages of kind `review` (others are 400)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`targets` は、置き場のページの path（`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`。本文"
"の道と同じ形）か、空白と制御字の無い `https://…`（2048 字まで。byte でなく字"
"で数える）。1 度に 100 個まで。足すだけで、同じ物は 1 つ（1 度の要求の中で重"
"ねても）、書いた順。足すとページ 1 枚で 100 個を超えるなら 400（判定も替えな"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"`targets` are paths of pages in the tray (`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-"
"<n>.html`; the same shape as the body route) or `https://…` without spaces "
"or control characters (up to 2048 characters, counted as characters, not "
"bytes). Up to 100 per request. They are only added, a target is kept once "
"(even when repeated in one request), in the order written. If adding would "
"make more than 100 on one page, it is 400 (the verdict does not change "
"either)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"無いページも、消したページも 404。ページを消すと、見た物も消える（外のキーの "
"`on delete cascade`）。"
msgstr ""
"Both a missing page and a removed page are 404. Removing a page removes its "
"targets too (the foreign key's `on delete cascade`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文の知らない欄は読み飛ばす（上の「共通の決まり」の restJson1）。形の違う本"
"文（`targets` が並びでない など）は、生成した層が 400 "
"`SerializationException`。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown fields in the body are skipped (restJson1 in \"Common rules\" "
"above). A body of the wrong shape (`targets` not a list, and so on) is 400 "
"`SerializationException` from the generated layer."

#: src/api.md
msgid "書く接続・誤り・`Origin` は返事と同じ。"
msgstr "The write connection, errors, and `Origin` are the same as replies."

#: src/api.md
msgid "消す（DeletePages）"
msgstr "Removing (DeletePages)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`DELETE /api/pages?project=…[&key=…][&kind=…[&n=…]]`。合うページをみな消す"
"（戻せない）。答えは 200 の `{\"removed\":[path…]}`（置いた順。合う物が無けれ"
"ば空）。"
msgstr ""
"`DELETE /api/pages?project=…[&key=…][&kind=…[&n=…]]`. Removes every matching "
"page (cannot be undone). The answer is 200 with `{\"removed\":[path…]}` (in "
"the order put; empty if nothing matches)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`project` は要る（`.`・`..` は 400）。`key`・`kind`・`n` は、書けば絞る。"
"`kind` だけでもよい（project の中の、その種類をみな）。`n` には `key` と "
"`kind` が要る（無ければ 400「n を書くときは key と kind も書く」）。"
msgstr ""
"`project` is required (`.` and `..` are 400). `key`, `kind`, and `n` narrow "
"when given. `kind` alone is fine (every page of that kind in the project). "
"`n` needs `key` and `kind` (otherwise 400 saying to give key and kind with "
"n)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"消したページの番号は、消した時刻（残す字）と `removed` に残し、2 度使わない"
"（本文の URL は 410）。全文の索引の行も消える。見た物（`page_targets`）は外の"
"キーで一緒に消える。送り手の行は残る（足すだけの表）。"
msgstr ""
"The numbers of removed pages stay in `removed` with the time removed (the "
"stored string) and are never used twice (the body URL is 410). The full-text "
"index rows go too. The targets (`page_targets`) go with them through the "
"foreign key. Sender rows stay (an append-only table)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"1 つの取引で、番号を残す・索引の行を消す・ページを消す。書く接続を 2 秒待って"
"も取れなければ 503、DB の誤りは 500（どちらも何も消さない）。"
msgstr ""
"One transaction keeps the numbers, removes the index rows, and removes the "
"pages. If the write connection is not free after 2 seconds, it is 503; a DB "
"error is 500 (neither removes anything)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"だれが消してよいかは見ない（呼ぶ側が決める）。browser の中のページからは消せ"
"ない（UI と同じ `Origin` でも 403）。"
msgstr ""
"Who may delete is not checked (the caller decides). A page inside a browser "
"cannot delete (403 even with the same `Origin` as the UI)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file を置く（CreateFile）"
msgstr "Putting a file (CreateFile)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページから参照する file（画面の絵・PDF・字の file）を 1 つ置く。本文は中身を"
"そのまま。答えは 201 で、file の記録（中身は入らない）と、要求の `Host` で組"
"んだ `url`（header `Location` にも）。"
msgstr ""
"Puts one file that pages refer to (a screenshot, a PDF, a text file). The "
"body is the contents as is. The answer is 201 with the file record (the "
"contents are not included) and a `url` built from the request's `Host` (also "
"in the `Location` header)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページと同じ（`.`・`..`・`project` の `api` は 400）"
msgstr "Same as for pages (`.`, `..`, and `api` as `project` are 400)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`name`（引数。要る）"
msgstr "`name` (parameter; required)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`<語>.<拡張子>`。語は英小文字か数字で始まり、英小文字・数字・`-`・`_` で 1〜"
"64 字。拡張子は英数字で 1〜16 字。`.` は 1 つ（形の違いは、生成した層が 400）"
msgstr ""
"`<stem>.<ext>`. The stem starts with a lowercase letter or digit and has 1 "
"to 64 lowercase letters, digits, `-`, and `_`. The extension has 1 to 16 "
"letters and digits. Exactly one `.` (a wrong shape is 400 from the generated "
"layer)"

#: src/api.md src/db.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`role`"
msgstr "`role`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページと同じ形。一覧の UI から上げる時のほかは要る（無ければ 400「role が要"
"る」）。定義では `@required` にしない（一覧の UI は書かない）"
msgstr ""
"The same shape as for pages. Required except for uploads from the list UI "
"(otherwise 400 saying role is required). Not `@required` in the definition "
"(the list UI does not send it)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`workspace`・`n`・`createdAt`・`actorIssuer`・`actorRef`"
msgstr "`workspace`, `n`, `createdAt`, `actorIssuer`, `actorRef`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページと同じ（番号は語と拡張子ごと）"
msgstr "Same as for pages (numbers are per stem and extension)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`Content-Type`（header。要る）"
msgstr "`Content-Type` (header; required)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"拡張子の種類と同じ物（`;` の前を、大小を問わずに比べる。`; charset=…` などは"
"問わない）。無ければ、生成した層が 400 `ValidationException`（欄の path は `/"
"contentType`）"
msgstr ""
"The same type as the extension's (compared before `;`, ignoring case; "
"parameters such as `; charset=…` do not matter). If missing, the generated "
"layer answers 400 `ValidationException` (the field path is `/contentType`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"file の中身（空は、生成した層が 400。欄の path は `/body`）。16 MiB まで"
msgstr ""
"The file contents (empty is 400 from the generated layer; the field path is "
"`/body`). Up to 16 MiB"

#: src/api.md
msgid "受ける file の種類"
msgstr "Accepted file types"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`crates/server/src/files.rs` の `FILE_TYPES`。表に無い種類（動画・HTML・SVG "
"など）は受けない。"
msgstr ""
"`FILE_TYPES` in `crates/server/src/files.rs`. Types not in the table (video, "
"HTML, SVG, and so on) are not accepted."

#: src/api.md
msgid "拡張子"
msgstr "Extension"

#: src/api.md
msgid "返す時の `Content-Type`"
msgstr "`Content-Type` when returned"

#: src/api.md
msgid "中身の見方"
msgstr "Contents check"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`png`"
msgstr "`png`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/png`"
msgstr "`image/png`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が PNG の印"
msgstr "Starts with the PNG signature"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`jpg`・`jpeg`"
msgstr "`jpg`, `jpeg`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/jpeg`"
msgstr "`image/jpeg`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `FF D8 FF`"
msgstr "Starts with `FF D8 FF`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`gif`"
msgstr "`gif`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/gif`"
msgstr "`image/gif`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `GIF87a` か `GIF89a`"
msgstr "Starts with `GIF87a` or `GIF89a`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`webp`"
msgstr "`webp`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/webp`"
msgstr "`image/webp`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `RIFF` で、8〜11 byte 目が `WEBP`"
msgstr "Starts with `RIFF`, and bytes 8–11 (from 0) are `WEBP`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`pdf`"
msgstr "`pdf`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`application/pdf`"
msgstr "`application/pdf`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `%PDF-`"
msgstr "Starts with `%PDF-`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`txt`・`log`"
msgstr "`txt`, `log`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/plain; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/plain; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "UTF-8 で読めて、NUL が無い"
msgstr "Valid UTF-8 with no NUL"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`md`"
msgstr "`md`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/markdown; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/markdown; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "同上"
msgstr "Same as above"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`csv`"
msgstr "`csv`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/csv; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/csv; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`json`"
msgstr "`json`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`application/json; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`application/json; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"表に無い拡張子（大文字の `PNG` も）・拡張子と合わない `Content-Type`・頭が拡"
"張子の形でない中身は、415 `UnsupportedMediaType`（`message` に訳。受ける拡張"
"子の一覧・`.png の Content-Type は image/png`・`中身が .png の形でない`）。返"
"す時の `Content-Type` は、送った header でなく表の値。"
msgstr ""
"An extension not in the table (uppercase `PNG` too), a `Content-Type` that "
"does not match the extension, or contents whose head is not of the "
"extension's shape is 415 `UnsupportedMediaType` (the reason is in `message`: "
"the list of accepted extensions, the `Content-Type` the extension needs, or "
"that the contents are not of the extension's shape). The `Content-Type` "
"returned is the table's value, not the header that was sent."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"番号: 書かなければ、同じ `project`・`key`・語・拡張子の置いた番号と消した番号"
"の最大 + 1（初めは 1。`screen.png` を置くと `screen-1.png`、もう 1 度置くと "
"`screen-2.png`。前の物は残る）。書けばその番号で置き、置いた番号・消した番号"
"なら 409 `Conflict`（何も替えない）。ページの番号とは別に数える。"
msgstr ""
"Number: if not given, the largest put or removed number for the same "
"`project`, `key`, stem, and extension, plus 1 (1 at first; putting "
"`screen.png` makes `screen-1.png`, putting it again makes `screen-2.png`, "
"and the earlier one stays). If given, the file is put with that number, and "
"a number already put or removed is 409 `Conflict` (nothing changes). File "
"numbers are counted apart from page numbers."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`sha256` は中身の SHA-256（16 進の小文字）、`size` は byte の数、`type` は表"
"の `Content-Type`。"
msgstr ""
"`sha256` is the SHA-256 of the contents (lowercase hex), `size` is the "
"number of bytes, and `type` is the table's `Content-Type`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"検査の順: 引数の形（400）→ 引数の決まりと付随する id の組（400）→ 種類・"
"`Content-Type`・中身（415）→ castlist（400・503）→ DB（409・503）。castlist "
"には、ほかの検査を見終えてから聞く。送り手の残し方は、ページと同じ（上の「送"
"り手」）。"
msgstr ""
"Order of checks: parameter shapes (400) → parameter rules and the attached "
"id pair (400) → type, `Content-Type`, and contents (415) → castlist (400, "
"503) → DB (409, 503). castlist is asked only after the other checks pass. "
"Senders are kept as for pages (see \"Senders\" above)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI の form から上げた物（守りの層が `Origin` の例外として通し、印を付"
"けた物。下の「守りの層」）は、引数に何が書いてあっても、役割 `product-"
"manager`・workspace 空で残し、`n`・`createdAt`・`actorIssuer`・`actorRef` を"
"読まない（browser から担当を名乗らせない・取り込ませない。送り手の行も作らな"
"い）。引数の形の違いは、例外でも生成した層が 400 で断る。"
msgstr ""
"A file uploaded from the list UI's form (one the guard layer let through as "
"the `Origin` exception and marked; see \"Guard layer\" below) is stored with "
"role `product-manager` and an empty workspace whatever the parameters say, "
"and `n`, `createdAt`, `actorIssuer`, and `actorRef` are not read (a browser "
"cannot claim to be a role or import; no sender row is made). Parameters of "
"the wrong shape are still 400 from the generated layer, even for the "
"exception."

#: src/api.md
msgid "置いた後に、新着の知らせを送る（下の「新着の知らせ」）。"
msgstr "After putting, a notice is sent (see \"New-arrival notices\" below)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "決め:"
msgstr "Decisions:"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文の種類: 中身は `@httpPayload` の `blob`（`@mediaType` を付けない）にし、"
"要求の `Content-Type` を `@httpHeader(\"Content-Type\")` の欄 `contentType` "
"に結ぶ。`Content-Type` を欄に結ぶと、smithy-rs の server は `Content-Type` を"
"決まった値（`@mediaType` の無い blob なら `application/octet-stream`）と比べ"
"る検査を作らないので、どの種類でも handler まで届き、種類の決まりは handler "
"が見る（S3 の `PutObject` と同じ形）。"
msgstr ""
"Body type: the contents are an `@httpPayload` `blob` (without `@mediaType`), "
"and the request's `Content-Type` is bound to the member `contentType` with "
"`@httpHeader(\"Content-Type\")`. With `Content-Type` bound to a member, the "
"smithy-rs server does not generate the check that compares `Content-Type` "
"with a fixed value (`application/octet-stream` for a blob without "
"`@mediaType`), so any type reaches the handler, and the handler applies the "
"type rules (the same shape as S3's `PutObject`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"415 の型: 生成した層の `UnsupportedMediaTypeException`（操作の決めた "
"`Content-Type` でない要求。ページの本文が `text/html` でない時など）とは別"
"に、`ai.pagetray#UnsupportedMediaType`（`@httpError(415)`）を CreateFile の誤"
"りに置く。呼び手は header `X-Amzn-Errortype` で見分ける（`ai.common` には足さ"
"ない。file の種類は pagetray だけの決まり）。"
msgstr ""
"The 415 type: apart from the generated layer's "
"`UnsupportedMediaTypeException` (a request whose `Content-Type` is not the "
"one the operation expects, such as a page body that is not `text/html`), "
"`ai.pagetray#UnsupportedMediaType` (`@httpError(415)`) is among CreateFile's "
"errors. Callers tell them apart by the `X-Amzn-Errortype` header (it is not "
"added to `ai.common`; file types are a pagetray-only rule)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI の印: 守りの層が要求の extensions に `FromUi` を入れ、handler は "
"smithy-rs の `Extension` の取り出し（`Option<Extension<FromUi>>`）で読む"
"（`Host` を読む `RequestHost` と同じ道）。"
msgstr ""
"The list UI mark: the guard layer puts `FromUi` in the request's extensions, "
"and the handler reads it with smithy-rs's `Extension` extractor "
"(`Option<Extension<FromUi>>`), the same way `RequestHost` carries `Host`."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file を探す（ListFiles）"
msgstr "Searching files (ListFiles)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`project`・`key`・`role`・`workspace`"
msgstr "`project`, `key`, `role`, `workspace`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "同じ値の物。形は置く時と同じ（違えば 400）。`workspace=`（空）も条件"
msgstr ""
"Files with the same value. The shapes are the same as when putting "
"(otherwise 400). `workspace=` (empty) is also a condition"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"前後の空白を落とし、空なら絞らない。名（`<語>.<拡張子>`）に、小文字にした "
"`q` を含む物"
msgstr ""
"Leading and trailing spaces are dropped; empty means no filter. Files whose "
"name (`<stem>.<ext>`) contains `q` lowercased"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手の castlist のアクターの id。castlist の答えの無い送り手の file には当"
"たらない"
msgstr ""
"The castlist actor id of the sender. Files whose sender has no castlist "
"answer do not match"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`sort`・`maxResults`・`nextToken`"
msgstr "`sort`, `maxResults`, `nextToken`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`ListPages` と同じ（keyset。印の頭は `files` で、ページの検索の印は 400）"
msgstr ""
"Same as `ListPages` (keyset; the token starts with `files`, and a page "
"search token is 400)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"行は file の記録（`ai.pagetray#File`。中身と `url` は入らない）。送り手の欄"
"は、付随する id を書いて置いた時だけ。置いた答えと一覧の行は、`url` のほかは"
"同じ欄・同じ値。"
msgstr ""
"Rows are file records (`ai.pagetray#File`; no contents and no `url`). The "
"sender field only when attached ids were given at put time. The put answer "
"and the listed row have the same fields and values except `url`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`path` は、この server の中の path（`/<project>/<key>/files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子"
">`）。ページの URL（3 段）と違い 4 段で、3 段目が `files` なので、ぶつからな"
"い。ページからは、相対の path で参照する（同じ Key なら `files/"
"screen-1.png`、別の Key なら `../K-2/files/screen-1.png`）。"
msgstr ""
"`path` is a path within this server (`/<project>/<key>/files/<stem>-<n>."
"<ext>`). Unlike a page URL (3 segments), it has 4 segments with `files` as "
"the third, so the two do not collide. Pages refer to files by relative path "
"(`files/screen-1.png` for the same Key, `../K-2/files/screen-1.png` for "
"another Key)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"読む接続・誤りは `ListPages` と同じ。`explain query plan` の試験（`crates/"
"server/tests/files.rs`）が、files を索引なしに端から読まないこと、project・"
"key・送り手・`nextToken` の条件は索引で引くこと、条件の無い一覧と "
"`nextToken` は時刻の索引（`files_created`）の順に読むことを見る。"
msgstr ""
"Read connections and errors are the same as for `ListPages`. The `explain "
"query plan` test (`crates/server/tests/files.rs`) checks that files are "
"never read end to end without an index, that the project, key, sender, and "
"`nextToken` conditions use an index, and that a list without conditions and "
"`nextToken` read in the order of the time index (`files_created`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file を消す（DeleteFiles）"
msgstr "Removing files (DeleteFiles)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`DELETE /api/files?project=…[&key=…][&name=<語>.<拡張子>[&n=…]]`。合う file "
"をみな消す（戻せない）。答えは 200 の `{\"removed\":[path…]}`（置いた順。合う"
"物が無ければ空）。"
msgstr ""
"`DELETE /api/files?project=…[&key=…][&name=<stem>.<ext>[&n=…]]`. Removes "
"every matching file (cannot be undone). The answer is 200 with `{\"removed\":"
"[path…]}` (in the order put; empty if nothing matches)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`project` は要る（`.`・`..` は 400）。`key`・`name`・`n` は、書けば絞る。"
"`name` だけでもよい（project の中の、その名をみな）。`n` には `key` と "
"`name` が要る（無ければ 400「n を書くときは key と name も書く」）。`name` の"
"形は file を置く時と同じ（違えば生成した層が 400）。"
msgstr ""
"`project` is required (`.` and `..` are 400). `key`, `name`, and `n` narrow "
"when given. `name` alone is fine (every file of that name in the project). "
"`n` needs `key` and `name` (otherwise 400 saying to give key and name with "
"n). The shape of `name` is the same as when putting a file (otherwise the "
"generated layer answers 400)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"消した file の番号は、消した時刻（残す字）と `files_removed` に残し、2 度使わ"
"ない（中身の URL は 410）。ページは消えない（ページを消しても file は消えな"
"い）。送り手の行は残る。"
msgstr ""
"The numbers of removed files stay in `files_removed` with the time removed "
"(the stored string) and are never used twice (the contents URL is 410). "
"Pages are not removed (and removing pages does not remove files). Sender "
"rows stay."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"書く接続・誤り・`Origin`（一覧の UI と同じ `Origin` でも 403）はページを消す"
"時と同じ。消した時は、新着の知らせを送らない。"
msgstr ""
"Write connections, errors, and `Origin` (403 even with the same `Origin` as "
"the list UI) are the same as for removing pages. No notice is sent on "
"removal."

#: src/api.md
msgid "新着の知らせ（SSE）"
msgstr "Push of new arrivals (SSE)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/events`（手の道。`text/event-stream`）。聞き始めた後に、置いた・書"
"いた物の記録を 1 件ずつ流す（`crates/server/src/events.rs`）。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/events` (a hand-written route; `text/event-stream`). After a "
"listener starts, it streams the record of each thing put or written, one at "
"a time (`crates/server/src/events.rs`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "起きた事"
msgstr "What happened"

#: src/api.md
msgid "event の名"
msgstr "Event name"

#: src/api.md
msgid "data"
msgstr "data"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページを置いた（`CreatePage`）"
msgstr "A page was put (`CreatePage`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "無し（前からの受け手は、これだけを読む）"
msgstr "None (older listeners read only these)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページの記録（`ListPages` の行と同じ。`url`・`Location` は入らない）"
msgstr ""
"The page record (the same as a `ListPages` row; no `url` or `Location`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "file を置いた（`CreateFile`）"
msgstr "A file was put (`CreateFile`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`file`"
msgstr "`file`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "file の記録（`ListFiles` の行と同じ）"
msgstr "The file record (the same as a `ListFiles` row)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "返事の状態を書いた（`SetReplyState`。替わらなかった時も）"
msgstr ""
"The reply state was written (`SetReplyState`; also when nothing changed)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`reply`"
msgstr "`reply`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "書いた後のページの記録（答えと同じ）"
msgstr "The page record after the write (the same as the response)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "レビューの印を書いた（`AddReviewMarks`。替わらなかった時も）"
msgstr ""
"Review marks were written (`AddReviewMarks`; also when nothing changed)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`review`"
msgstr "`review`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"断った書き込み（400・404・409 など）と、消した時（`DeletePages`・"
"`DeleteFiles`）は送らない。答えの記録に直せてから送る（直せずに 500 を返す書"
"き込みは知らせない）。"
msgstr ""
"Refused writes (400, 404, 409, and so on) and removals (`DeletePages`, "
"`DeleteFiles`) send nothing. A notice is sent only after the response record "
"has been built (a write that returns 500 because the record cannot be built "
"is not announced)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"記録の形は API の答えと同じ camelCase（`createdAt`・`askedAt`・`waitsOn`・"
"`sender.resolvedAt` など。時刻は答えと同じ字）。"
msgstr ""
"The records have the same camelCase shape as the API responses (`createdAt`, "
"`askedAt`, `waitsOn`, `sender.resolvedAt`, and so on; times are the same "
"text as in the responses)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"broadcast の channel（容量 64）。聞き手が無くても失敗にしない。遅れて取りこぼ"
"した聞き手は、捨てた分を飛ばして続ける（画面は一覧を読み直せば出る）。keep-"
"alive は axum の既定（15 秒ごとの注釈の行）。"
msgstr ""
"A broadcast channel (capacity 64). Having no listener is not a failure. A "
"listener that falls behind skips what was dropped and goes on (the screen "
"shows it by reloading the list). Keep-alive is axum's default (a comment "
"line every 15 seconds)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"守りの層は、ほかの道と同じ（`Host` を見る。時間切れは答えの頭までなので、流し"
"続ける本文には掛からない）。"
msgstr ""
"The guard layer is the same as for the other routes (it checks `Host`; the "
"timeout covers only the response head, so it does not cut off the ongoing "
"stream)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "画面"
msgstr "Screens"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI（手の道。`/`・`/{project}/`・`/{project}/{key}/`。`crates/server/"
"src/ui.rs`）。URL が開くことは仕様に入るが、HTML の作り・見た目・文は入らな"
"い。"
msgstr ""
"The list UI (hand-written routes: `/`, `/{project}/`, `/{project}/{key}/`; "
"`crates/server/src/ui.rs`). That the URLs open is part of the specification; "
"the HTML structure, the look, and the wording are not."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"template は、repo の `templates/index.html`（askama。`crates/server/"
"askama.toml` が `../../templates` を指す。castlist と同じ形）。上げる枠の送り"
"先は、置き場が `data-upload` に渡す（`/api/projects/{project}/keys/{key}/"
"files`。script が `name` の引数を足し、選んだ file の `Content-Type` で送"
"る）。断った訳は `message` を読む。"
msgstr ""
"The template is the repo's `templates/index.html` (askama; `crates/server/"
"askama.toml` points at `../../templates`, the same setup as castlist). The "
"store passes where the upload box sends to in `data-upload` (`/api/projects/"
"{project}/keys/{key}/files`; the script adds the `name` parameter and sends "
"with the chosen file's `Content-Type`). For the reason of a refusal, it "
"reads `message`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`・`q`・`reply`・`on`・"
"`verdict`・`actor`・`sort`・`at`・`open`。空は書かないのと同じ（`workspace` "
"だけは空も条件）。知らない `reply`・`verdict` は無視、`on` は `reply` と組の"
"時だけ、`sort` は `created_at` だけ、`open` はページの path の形だけ。1 度に "
"200 件。同じ名の引数を 2 度書いた物など、読めない引数は 400 "
"`ValidationException`。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace`, `q`, `reply`, "
"`on`, `verdict`, `actor`, `sort`, `at`, `open`. An empty value is the same "
"as leaving it out (only `workspace` treats empty as a condition). Unknown "
"`reply` and `verdict` values are ignored, `on` counts only together with "
"`reply`, `sort` accepts only `created_at`, and `open` accepts only the shape "
"of a page path. 200 rows at a time. Parameters that cannot be read, such as "
"the same name given twice, get 400 `ValidationException`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"続きの印 `at` は、前の頁の最後の行の時刻と id（`nextToken` と同じ形）。同じ時"
"刻の行が頁の境に並んでも抜けない（`crates/server/tests/ui.rs` が、同じ時刻の "
"205 枚を抜けずに出すことを見る）。読めない印・ほかの並びの印は、書かないのと"
"同じ（頭から出す）。"
msgstr ""
"The continuation mark `at` is the time and id of the previous page's last "
"row (the same shape as `nextToken`). Rows with the same time at a page "
"boundary are not lost (`crates/server/tests/ui.rs` checks that 205 pages "
"with the same time all show). A mark that cannot be read, or one from the "
"other sort order, is the same as leaving it out (the list starts from the "
"top)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"待ちの数（返事待ち・レビュー待ち・上げた）と絞り込みの候補は、絞りに関わらず"
"置き場の全部。tab の題は Product Manager の返事待ちの数（`crates/server/src/"
"facets.rs`）。"
msgstr ""
"The waiting counts (awaiting reply, awaiting review, escalated) and the "
"filter choices cover the whole store, whatever the filters. The tab title "
"shows the number of pages awaiting the Product Manager's reply (`crates/"
"server/src/facets.rs`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手は、castlist の名に castlist のアクターの画面への link"
"（`<PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL>/actors/<id>`。castlist を設定していて、答えの"
"ある送り手だけ）と、その下に小さく付随する id。答えの無い送り手は「未確認」。"
"絞り込みの「送り手」は、答えのある送り手を、ページの多い順に 100 まで。"
msgstr ""
"A sender shows its castlist name, linked to the castlist actor's page "
"(`<PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL>/actors/<id>`; only when castlist is "
"configured and the sender has an answer), with the attached id small below "
"it. A sender without an answer reads \"unconfirmed\". The \"Sender\" filter "
"lists the senders with an answer, most pages first, up to 100."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"字はみな HTML として逃がし、URL の引数に入れる値は、英数字と `-` `.` `_` `~` "
"のほかを %XX にする（`actorRef` は castlist と同じ広い形で、空白・`?`・`&`・"
"`#`・`/` も通る）。"
msgstr ""
"All text is escaped as HTML, and values put into URL parameters have every "
"character other than letters, digits, `-`, `.`, `_`, and `~` written as %XX "
"(`actorRef` has the same wide shape as in castlist, so spaces, `?`, `&`, "
"`#`, and `/` get through)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"Key の画面（project と Key を 1 つずつ選んだ時）だけ、file の枠と上げる枠を出"
"す（project が `api` なら出さない）。本文の枠の iframe は `sandbox=\"allow-"
"scripts\"`。"
msgstr ""
"Only the Key view (one project and one Key chosen) shows the file box and "
"the upload box (not when the project is `api`). The viewer's iframe has "
"`sandbox=\"allow-scripts\"`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"答えの頭: 守りの層の `nosniff`・`no-referrer` に足して、`Content-Security-"
"Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'sha256-…'; style-src 'sha256-…'; img-"
"src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self'; frame-src 'self'; frame-"
"ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'`。inline の style と "
"script は template の物の hash だけを許す（hash は template から作る）。図は"
"置き場の file と、上げる前の見本（`blob:`）と favicon（`data:`）、本文の枠は"
"置き場のページ、知らせと上げる枠の送り先は置き場だけ。"
msgstr ""
"Response headers: on top of the guard layer's `nosniff` and `no-referrer`, "
"`Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'sha256-…'; style-"
"src 'sha256-…'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self'; frame-src "
"'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'`. Only "
"the template's own inline style and script are allowed, by hash (the hashes "
"are made from the template). Images are the store's files, the preview "
"before uploading (`blob:`), and the favicon (`data:`); the viewer shows only "
"the store's pages; the notices and the upload box talk only to the store."

#: src/api.md
msgid "起こし方"
msgstr "Starting it"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"起こす binary は `pagetray-server`（`crates/server/src/main.rs`）。image"
"（`Containerfile`）に `/pagetray-server` の名で入る（[release を出す]"
"(release.md)）。"
msgstr ""
"The startup binary is `pagetray-server` (`crates/server/src/main.rs`). It "
"goes into the image (`Containerfile`) under the name `/pagetray-server` "
"([Releasing](release.md))."

#: src/api.md
msgid "引数は付けない。引数を付けると、使い方を出して 2 で終わる。"
msgstr ""
"It takes no arguments. Given arguments, it prints the usage and exits with 2."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"環境変数: `PAGETRAY_DB`（既定 `/data/pages.db`）・`PAGETRAY_LISTEN`（既定 "
"`0.0.0.0:8080`）・`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`・`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`（上の"
"「送り手」）。"
msgstr ""
"Environment variables: `PAGETRAY_DB` (default `/data/pages.db`), "
"`PAGETRAY_LISTEN` (default `0.0.0.0:8080`), `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`, and "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` (see \"Senders\" above)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"起きずに 1 で終わる物: castlist の設定の形が違う時（stderr に訳を書き、DB も"
"記録の置き場も作らない）と、DB を開けない時（後の版の DB を含む。下の「デー"
"タ」。記録の置き場に訳を残す）。"
msgstr ""
"It exits with 1 without starting when the castlist settings are in the wrong "
"shape (it writes the reason to stderr and creates neither the DB nor the log "
"place), and when it cannot open the DB (including a DB from a later version; "
"see \"Data\" below. The reason is left in the log place)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"記録の置き場は DB の隣の `logs/`（大きさで回す記録の file・終わり方の印・生き"
"ている印。[動かす](run.md) の「落ちた後に調べる」）。起きて初めに前の回の終わ"
"り方の行（`previous: …`）、待ち受けたら起きた行（`pagetray <版> listen=… db=…"
"`。castlist を設定すれば後ろに ` castlist=… castlist_link=…`）。"
msgstr ""
"The log place is `logs/` next to the DB (size-rotated log files, run marks, "
"and the alive mark; \"Investigating after a crash\" in [Running](run.md)). "
"On start, the first line is how the previous run ended (`previous: …`), and "
"once listening, the start line (`pagetray <version> listen=… db=…`, followed "
"by ` castlist=… castlist_link=…` when castlist is set)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"問い合わせごとの 1 行（method・uri・status・latency）は記録の file にだけ書"
"き、stdout には出さない（下の「守りの層」）。"
msgstr ""
"The one line per request (method, uri, status, latency) goes to the log file "
"only, not to stdout (see \"Guard layer\" below)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"SIGTERM と SIGINT で新しい問い合わせを断り、新着の知らせの流れを閉じ、走って"
"いる物を終えてから閉じる（印は `signal` と `stopped`）。知らせの流れは聞き手"
"が切るまで続くので、閉じないと止まらない。走っている物を待つのは 3 秒"
"（`SHUTDOWN_WAIT`。問い合わせの時間切れ 5 秒と、container を止める命令が "
"SIGKILL を送るまでの待ちより短い）まで。過ぎたら記録に `stop wait exceeded "
"wait=3s` を書き、DB を閉じて 0 で終わる（印は `stopped`。固まって切られた時と"
"見分けられる）。ただし backup の写しを作っている間に合図が来ると、DB を閉じる"
"のは写しを作り終えるまで待つ（その分は上限に入らない）。"
msgstr ""
"On SIGTERM and SIGINT it refuses new requests, closes the new-arrival "
"streams, and finishes what is running before closing (marks `signal` and "
"`stopped`). A new-arrival stream lasts until the listener hangs up, so it "
"would not stop without closing them. It waits for running requests for up to "
"3 seconds (`SHUTDOWN_WAIT`; shorter than the 5-second request timeout and "
"than the wait before the container stop command sends SIGKILL). After that "
"it writes `stop wait exceeded wait=3s` to the log, closes the DB, and exits "
"with 0 (mark `stopped`, so it can be told apart from being killed while "
"stuck). However, if a signal arrives while a backup copy is being made, "
"closing the DB waits until the copy is finished (that time is not covered by "
"the limit)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "記録の書き手は `crates/server/src/runlog.rs`。"
msgstr "The log writer is `crates/server/src/runlog.rs`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"試験: 本物の binary を空いた port で起こす物は `crates/server/tests/"
"server.rs`（守りの層・backup・止め方・起きた行）と `crates/server/tests/"
"runlog.rs`（前の回の終わり方・問い合わせの行・logs・上限で回る）。道具は "
"`crates/server/tests/common/server.rs`。backup と logs の中身は `crates/"
"server/tests/backup.rs`（Router を直に呼ぶ）。"
msgstr ""
"Tests: those that start the real binary on a free port are `crates/server/"
"tests/server.rs` (guard layer, backup, stopping, the start line) and `crates/"
"server/tests/runlog.rs` (how the previous run ended, request lines, logs, "
"rotating at the limit). The helper is `crates/server/tests/common/"
"server.rs`. The contents of backup and logs are checked in `crates/server/"
"tests/backup.rs` (calling the Router directly)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"e2e の試験（`e2e/`）が、この binary を起こして一覧の UI を本物の browser で見"
"る（[開発](development.md) の「一覧の UI の試験」）。"
msgstr ""
"The e2e tests (`e2e/`) start this binary and look at the list UI in a real "
"browser (\"List UI tests\" in [Development](development.md))."

#: src/api.md
msgid "ページの本文"
msgstr "Page body"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /{project}/{key}/{kind}-{n}.html`（手の道）。"
msgstr "`GET /{project}/{key}/{kind}-{n}.html` (a hand-written route)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"形の合わない URL（`kind` が名の形でない・`n` が頭に 0 のある数や 0・`.html` "
"でない）は 404 `NotFound`。"
msgstr ""
"A URL of the wrong shape (`kind` not a name, `n` with a leading zero or 0, "
"not `.html`) is 404 `NotFound`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置いたページは 200 で、置いたままの byte。`Content-Type: text/html; "
"charset=utf-8`・`Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts`（隔てた枠と"
"して出す。ページの中の script は動くが、置き場の名で API を呼べない）・`X-"
"Content-Type-Options: nosniff`。"
msgstr ""
"A page that was put is 200 with the bytes exactly as put. `Content-Type: "
"text/html; charset=utf-8`, `Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts` "
"(shown as an isolated frame: scripts in the page run, but cannot call the "
"API under the store's origin), `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"無いページは 404 `NotFound`、消したページは 410 `Gone`（`message` に消した時"
"刻）。"
msgstr ""
"A missing page is 404 `NotFound`; a removed page is 410 `Gone` (the time it "
"was removed is in `message`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file の中身"
msgstr "File contents"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /{project}/{key}/files/{語}-{n}.{拡張子}`（手の道）。"
msgstr "`GET /{project}/{key}/files/{stem}-{n}.{ext}` (a hand-written route)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"形の合わない URL（語が名の形でない・受けない拡張子（大文字も）・`n` が頭に 0 "
"のある数や 0）は 404 `NotFound`。"
msgstr ""
"A URL of the wrong shape (a stem not of the name shape, an extension not "
"accepted (uppercase too), `n` with a leading zero or 0) is 404 `NotFound`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置いた file は 200 で、置いたままの byte。`Content-Type` は置いた時に表で決め"
"た物・`Content-Security-Policy: sandbox`（直に開いても中の script を動かさな"
"い）・`X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`・`Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, "
"immutable`（同じ URL の中身は替わらない。上げ直すと次の番号）。"
msgstr ""
"A stored file is 200 with the stored bytes as is. `Content-Type` is the one "
"chosen from the table when it was put, with `Content-Security-Policy: "
"sandbox` (scripts do not run even when opened directly), `X-Content-Type-"
"Options: nosniff`, and `Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable` (the "
"contents at a URL never change; uploading again gives the next number)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"無い file は 404 `NotFound`、消した file は 410 `Gone`（`message` に消した時"
"刻）。読む接続を待ちきれなければ 503、DB の誤りは 500。"
msgstr ""
"A missing file is 404 `NotFound`; a removed file is 410 `Gone` (the time it "
"was removed is in `message`). 503 if no read connection is free in time, 500 "
"on a DB error."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページの本文の道と段の数が違うので、種類 `files` のページ（`/{project}/{key}/"
"files-1.html`）とぶつからない。"
msgstr ""
"The number of path segments differs from the page body route, so it does not "
"clash with a page of kind `files` (`/{project}/{key}/files-1.html`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "守りの層"
msgstr "Guard layer"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"生成した道と手の道の前に、外から順に掛ける（`crates/server/src/guard.rs`。"
"castlist と同じ作り）。断る答えは restJson1 の形。"
msgstr ""
"Applied in front of the generated routes and the hand-written routes, from "
"the outside in (`crates/server/src/guard.rs`; built the same way as "
"castlist). Refusals are in the restJson1 shape."

#: src/api.md
msgid "順"
msgstr "Order"

#: src/api.md
msgid "守り"
msgstr "Guard"

#: src/api.md
msgid "振る舞い"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: src/api.md
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭の印"
msgstr "Header stamps"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"どの答えにも `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` と `Referrer-Policy: no-"
"referrer`。CSP は、本文の道と画面が自分で付ける（上の「ページの本文」「file "
"の中身」「画面」）"
msgstr ""
"Every response gets `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` and `Referrer-Policy: "
"no-referrer`. The body routes and the screens set their own CSP (see \"Page "
"body\", \"File contents\", and \"Screens\" above)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: src/api.md
msgid "問い合わせの記録"
msgstr "Request log"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"1 つにつき 1 行（method・uri・status・latency。tower-http の TraceLayer）。記"
"録の file にだけ書き、stdout には出さない。断った物も残る"
msgstr ""
"One line per request (method, uri, status, latency; tower-http's "
"TraceLayer). Written to the log file only, not to stdout. Refused requests "
"are logged too"

#: src/api.md
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: src/api.md
msgid "Host と Origin"
msgstr "Host and Origin"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`Host`（port を外して）が 127.0.0.1・localhost でなければ、`GET`・`HEAD` のほ"
"かの要求に `Origin` が付いていれば、403 `Forbidden`。例外は 1 つだけ: 一覧の "
"UI の form が file を上げる `POST /api/projects/{project}/keys/{key}/files`"
"（後ろに何も付かない道）で、`Origin` が `http://<Host（port も）>` とそのまま"
"同じで、`Sec-Fetch-Site` が無いか `same-origin` の物。印（`FromUi`）を付けて"
"通す（上の「file を置く」）。ほかの道・本文の枠の中のページ（`Origin: "
"null`）・ほかの port や名や `https` は 403"
msgstr ""
"403 `Forbidden` if `Host` (without the port) is not 127.0.0.1 or localhost, "
"or if a request other than `GET` or `HEAD` has an `Origin`. There is exactly "
"one exception: the list UI's form uploading a file with `POST /api/projects/"
"{project}/keys/{key}/files` (nothing after it in the path), where `Origin` "
"is exactly `http://<Host (with the port)>` and `Sec-Fetch-Site` is absent or "
"`same-origin`. It is let through with a mark (`FromUi`) (see \"Putting a "
"file\" above). Other routes, a page inside the body frame (`Origin: null`), "
"and other ports, names, or `https` are 403"

#: src/api.md
msgid "HEAD"
msgstr "HEAD"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`GET` にして通し、本文を捨てる（生成した骨の道は GET だけなので、ここで揃え"
"る）"
msgstr ""
"Passed on as `GET`, with the body dropped (the generated skeleton's routes "
"are GET only, so this layer makes them match)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: src/api.md
msgid "時間切れ"
msgstr "Timeout"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"答えの頭まで 5 秒（`REQUEST_TIMEOUT`）を過ぎれば 503 `Unavailable`（待ってい"
"る物は捨てる）。本文を送る間は数えないので、大きな backup の file や新着の知"
"らせの流れを途中で切らない。試験は `Config` で短くする。接続を待つ長さ（書く "
"`WRITE_WAIT` 2 秒・読む `READ_WAIT` 3 秒）は、これより短くする（混んでいる時"
"に「混んでいる」の 503 が先に答える。`crates/server/tests/guard.rs` で止めて"
"いる）"
msgstr ""
"If the response head takes longer than 5 seconds (`REQUEST_TIMEOUT`), 503 "
"`Unavailable` (what was waiting is dropped). The time spent sending the body "
"is not counted, so a large backup file or a new-arrival stream is not cut "
"off. Tests shorten it through `Config`. The connection waits (`WRITE_WAIT` 2 "
"seconds for writing, `READ_WAIT` 3 seconds for reading) are shorter than "
"this (so that when busy, the \"busy\" 503 answers first; pinned by `crates/"
"server/tests/guard.rs`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文の上限"
msgstr "Body limit"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"16 MiB（`MAX_BODY`。ページも file も）。`Content-Length` で超えると言う要求は"
"読まずに、大きさを言わずに流す要求は 16 MiB まで読んで、413 `PayloadTooLarge`"
"（何も置かない）。ちょうど 16 MiB は通る。生成した層は本文をみな読んでから引"
"数にするので、ここで読んでおく（smithy-rs の生成した層にも本文の上限の設定が"
"あるが、既定は上限無しで、超えた時の答えが 413 にならない）。本文を読む間も、"
"外の層の 5 秒の時間切れに数える（送り手は同じ機械の中の roster と一覧の UI な"
"ので、16 MiB でも 5 秒よりずっと短く届く。遅い送り手に書く接続を握らせない利"
"点もある）"
msgstr ""
"16 MiB (`MAX_BODY`; pages and files alike). A request whose `Content-Length` "
"says more is refused without reading, and a request streamed without a size "
"is read up to 16 MiB, both with 413 `PayloadTooLarge` (nothing is stored). "
"Exactly 16 MiB passes. The generated layer reads the whole body before "
"building the input, so the body is read here (the generated smithy-rs layer "
"also has a body limit setting, but its default is no limit and exceeding it "
"does not answer 413). Reading the body also counts toward the outer layer's "
"5-second timeout (the senders are roster and the list UI on the same "
"machine, so even 16 MiB arrives well within 5 seconds; it also keeps a slow "
"sender from holding the write connection)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "データ"
msgstr "Data"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"DB は SQLite で、表は `crates/server/migrations/` の SQL で作る（[DB の作り]"
"(db.md)）。"
msgstr ""
"The DB is SQLite, and the tables are made by the SQL in `crates/server/"
"migrations/` ([DB schema](db.md))."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"接続は castlist と同じ: 書く接続は 1 本（`WRITE_WAIT` 2 秒まで待つ）、読む接"
"続は読むだけの 4 本（`READ_WAIT` 3 秒）。どの接続も WAL・`foreign_keys`・"
"`recursive_triggers`・`busy_timeout` 5 秒・一時の物は memory。開く時に移行を"
"当て、`foreign_key_check` に崩れがあれば開かない。"
msgstr ""
"Connections are the same as castlist: a single write connection (waiting up "
"to `WRITE_WAIT`, 2 seconds) and 4 read-only connections (`READ_WAIT`, 3 "
"seconds). Every connection has WAL, `foreign_keys`, `recursive_triggers`, a "
"5-second `busy_timeout`, and temporary data in memory. Opening applies the "
"migrations and refuses to open if `foreign_key_check` finds broken rows."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"0.8.x の DB は、v1.0.0 の image の `migrate` で新しい volume へ移した（AI-36 "
"の切り替え。手順と照らしは [release を出す](release.md) の「切り替え（済"
"み）」）。"
msgstr ""
"The 0.8.x database was moved to a new volume with the v1.0.0 image's "
"`migrate` (the AI-36 switch-over; the steps and checks are in \"Switch-over "
"(done)\" in [Releasing](release.md))."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`_sqlx_migrations` に、`crates/server/migrations/` に無い版か、中身の写しの違"
"う版がある DB は、開かない（sqlx の移行が、当てる前に突き合わせて断る）。移行"
"は 1 つも当てないが、記録の置き場（`logs/`）と WAL の file（`-wal`・`-shm`）"
"は書く。無い版がこの server の最も新しい版より後なら、後の版（移行を足した"
"版）が書いた DB として、「この server より新しい版の DB。…書いた版の image で"
"起こす」の訳で断る。ほかは「DB の移行に落ちた: …」。binary は 1 で終わる。試"
"験は `crates/server/tests/migrations.rs`（出した migrations の中身が 1 byte "
"も替わっていないことも見る）。"
msgstr ""
"A database whose `_sqlx_migrations` has a version not in `crates/server/"
"migrations/`, or one whose checksum differs, is not opened (sqlx's migrator "
"checks before applying anything and refuses). No migration is applied, but "
"the log place (`logs/`) and the WAL files (`-wal`, `-shm`) are written. If "
"the missing version is later than this server's newest version, it is "
"refused as a database written by a later version (one that added "
"migrations), with the reason \"a database of a newer version than this "
"server; … start it with the image of the version that wrote it\". Otherwise "
"the reason is \"DB migration failed: …\". The binary exits with 1. The test "
"is `crates/server/tests/migrations.rs` (it also checks that the released "
"migrations have not changed by even one byte)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "定義の取り方"
msgstr "How the model is fetched"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"pagetray の定義は `model/model/pagetray.smithy`（名前空間 `ai.pagetray`）。共"
"通の形 `ai.common` は castlist の `model/model/common.smithy` を使う。"
msgstr ""
"The pagetray model is `model/model/pagetray.smithy` (namespace "
"`ai.pagetray`). The common shapes `ai.common` come from castlist's `model/"
"model/common.smithy`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`ci/gen.sh` が、castlist の release の tag（今は `v1.0.0`）の "
"`common.smithy` と `castlist.smithy` を `model/castlist/` に取り、`ci/"
"gen.sh` に固めた SHA-256 と合うかを見てから置く。tag と 2 つの digest は `ci/"
"gen.sh` の 1 か所に書く。取った定義は commit するので、`ci/gen.sh --check` "
"は castlist に取りに行かず、入れてある物が digest と合うかを見る。"
msgstr ""
"`ci/gen.sh` fetches `common.smithy` and `castlist.smithy` at a castlist "
"release tag (now `v1.0.0`) into `model/castlist/`, after checking that they "
"match the SHA-256 values pinned in `ci/gen.sh`. The tag and the two digests "
"are written in one place in `ci/gen.sh`. The fetched model is committed, so "
"`ci/gen.sh --check` does not fetch from castlist; it checks that the "
"committed files match the digests."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"1 つの Smithy の build から、3 つの crate を作る: pagetray の server の骨"
"（`crates/pagetray-sdk/`。smithy-rs の codegen-server 0.1.40・`http-1x`・"
"`publicConstrainedTypes: false`）と、castlist を呼ぶ crate（`crates/castlist-"
"client/`。codegen-client 0.1.40 の `rust-client-codegen`。http 1 の形）と、"
"pagetray を呼ぶ crate（`crates/pagetray-client/`。同じ `rust-client-codegen` "
"を、`model/smithy-build.json` の `rust-client-codegen::pagetray-client`"
"（`<plugin>::<名>`）の名でもう 1 度使う）。castlist を呼ぶ crate は送り手を "
"castlist に聞く処理（上の「送り手」）で、pagetray を呼ぶ crate は人が打つ CLI"
"（[CLI](cli.md)）で使う。"
msgstr ""
"One Smithy build makes three crates: pagetray's server skeleton (`crates/"
"pagetray-sdk/`; smithy-rs codegen-server 0.1.40, `http-1x`, "
"`publicConstrainedTypes: false`), the crate that calls castlist (`crates/"
"castlist-client/`; `rust-client-codegen` from codegen-client 0.1.40, in the "
"http 1 shape), and the crate that calls pagetray (`crates/pagetray-client/`; "
"the same `rust-client-codegen` used a second time under the name `rust-"
"client-codegen::pagetray-client` (`<plugin>::<name>`) in `model/smithy-"
"build.json`). The castlist crate is used when asking castlist for the sender "
"(\"Senders\" above), and the pagetray crate is used by the CLI that people "
"type ([CLI](cli.md))."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"呼ぶ側の 2 つの crate の既定の features から、https の client（rustls・aws-"
"lc）を外す（`ci/gen.sh` が `Cargo.toml` の 1 行を替える）。pagetray が "
"castlist を呼ぶのも、CLI が pagetray を呼ぶのも同じ機械の中の `http://` だけ"
"なので、TLS の crate を build しない。HTTP の client は、使う側が設定で渡す"
"（TLS の無い HTTP/1.1。上の「送り手」）。castlist を 1 度呼べること・1 秒の時"
"間切れ・送り直さないことは、`crates/server/tests/senders.rs` が偽の castlist "
"で止める。"
msgstr ""
"The https client (rustls, aws-lc) is removed from the default features of "
"both calling crates (`ci/gen.sh` replaces one line of `Cargo.toml`). "
"pagetray calls castlist, and the CLI calls pagetray, only over `http://` "
"within the same machine, so no TLS crate is built. The HTTP client is passed "
"in by the user through configuration (HTTP/1.1 without TLS; \"Senders\" "
"above). That castlist is called once, the 1-second timeout, and that "
"requests are not retried are pinned by `crates/server/tests/senders.rs` with "
"a fake castlist."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"例（`@httpRequestTests`・`@httpResponseTests`）の id は、castlist の定義と 1 "
"つの model に入るので重なれない。pagetray の物は頭に `Pagetray` を付ける。"
msgstr ""
"The ids of the examples (`@httpRequestTests`, `@httpResponseTests`) share "
"one model with castlist's, so they must not collide. pagetray's start with "
"`Pagetray`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image と、release に付ける CLI の binary は public で、だれでも取って中を見ら"
"れる。**出すのは release の workflow（`.github/workflows/release.yml`）だけ**"
"で、手元から `push` せず、release に file を手で付けない（手元の build には、"
"commit していない file と、自分の home の path が入りうる）。"
msgstr ""
"The image and the CLI binary attached to a release are public, and anyone "
"can get them and look inside. **Only the release workflow (`.github/"
"workflows/release.yml`) publishes them**; never `push` from your local "
"machine and never attach files to a release by hand (a local build can "
"include files that are not committed, and the path of your own home "
"directory)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`Cargo.toml` の `[workspace.package]` の `version` を上げ、`CHANGELOG.md` に"
"節を足す PR を merge する。"
msgstr ""
"Merge a PR that bumps `version` under `[workspace.package]` in `Cargo.toml` "
"and adds a section to `CHANGELOG.md`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"main のその commit に tag を打って push する: `git tag v<version> && git "
"push origin v<version>`。"
msgstr ""
"Tag that commit on main and push the tag: `git tag v<version> && git push "
"origin v<version>`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"workflow の `check` が、tag と版が合うか・image の中身の一覧・設定・秘密の走"
"査（下の「image に入る物」）・動くかを見る。`check-cli` が、CLI の binary の"
"形・つながる library・版・秘密の走査（下の「release に付ける CLI に入る"
"物」）・動くかを見る。**1 つでも落ちれば、`push` は動かず、image も CLI も出"
"ない。**"
msgstr ""
"The workflow's `check` verifies that the tag matches the version, the "
"image's contents list, its configuration, the secret scan (see \"What goes "
"into the image\" below), and that the image runs. `check-cli` verifies the "
"CLI binary's format, linked libraries, version, the secret scan (see \"What "
"goes into the CLI attached to a release\" below), and that it runs. **If "
"even one of these fails, `push` does not run, and neither the image nor the "
"CLI is published.**"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`push` が、確かめたその image（作り直さない）を `ghcr.io/uraitakahito/"
"pagetray:v<version>` に置き、release に digest と中身の一覧を書き、確かめたそ"
"の CLI の tar と checksum を付ける。同じ tag がもうあれば置かない。"
msgstr ""
"`push` pushes that verified image (without rebuilding it) to `ghcr.io/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>`, writes the digest and the contents list "
"to the release, and attaches that verified CLI tar and its checksum. If the "
"same tag already exists, it does not push."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release の中身の一覧が「`pagetray-server` と空の `data` だけ」であることと、"
"付いた file が `pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` とその "
"`.sha256` の 2 つだけであることを見る（この時、image も CLI ももう public。"
"違っていたら、すぐ下の「機微な物が出てしまった時」をする）。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the contents list in the release is \"only `pagetray-server` and "
"an empty `data`\", and that the attached files are only `pagetray-v<version>-"
"aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` and its `.sha256` (at this point the image and "
"the CLI are already public; if anything differs, do \"If something sensitive "
"got out\" just below)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"roster の `.pagetray-version` を上げる PR を出す（つなぎの試験が、その image "
"に向けて通る）。"
msgstr ""
"Open a PR that bumps `.pagetray-version` in roster (the integration tests "
"run against that image and pass)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"出した tag は打ち直さない（digest が変わり、書き留めた値と合わなくなる）。直"
"す時は、次の版を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Never re-tag a published tag (the digest changes and no longer matches the "
"recorded value). To fix something, publish the next version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**rc**: tag に `-rc.` の付く物（`v<版>-rc.<n>`。`Cargo.toml` の版も "
"`CHANGELOG.md` の節も `<版>-rc.<n>`）は、GitHub の pre-release にする。作り方"
"と確かめは、ほかの tag と同じ。"
msgstr ""
"**rc**: A tag with `-rc.` (`v<version>-rc.<n>`; the version in `Cargo.toml` "
"and the section in `CHANGELOG.md` are also `<version>-rc.<n>`) becomes a "
"GitHub pre-release. It is built and checked the same way as any other tag."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image は `Containerfile` で作る（server の crate `crates/server`（package "
"`pagetray-server`）の binary `pagetray-server` を `/pagetray-server` に置"
"く）。確かめは `ci/smoke-image.sh <image>`。smoke の終わりに、出した v1.0.0 "
"の image（`ci/smoke-image.sh` に digest で固める）が書いた volume を、確かめ"
"る image で開いて読めるかも見る（出した移行の SQL を替えると、ここで断られ"
"る）。だから release の確かめは、ghcr.io の v1.0.0 の image に頼る（下の「機"
"微な物が出てしまった時」で v1.0.0 を消すなら、先に smoke を替える PR を出"
"す）。"
msgstr ""
"The image is built with the `Containerfile` (it puts the binary `pagetray-"
"server` of the server crate `crates/server` (package `pagetray-server`) at `/"
"pagetray-server`). It is verified with `ci/smoke-image.sh <image>`. At the "
"end, the smoke test also checks that the image being verified can open and "
"read a volume written by the released v1.0.0 image (pinned by digest in `ci/"
"smoke-image.sh`; changing released migration SQL is refused here). So "
"release verification depends on the v1.0.0 image on ghcr.io (if you delete "
"v1.0.0 under \"If something sensitive got out\" below, first open a PR that "
"changes the smoke test)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release に付ける CLI は `crates/cli`（package `pagetray`・binary "
"`pagetray`）。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI attached to a release is `crates/cli` (package `pagetray`, binary "
"`pagetray`)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**0.8.x は、もう出さない**: 0.8.x の server と、0.8.x の API に向けた CLI の "
"code は消したので、直して出す道は無い。直しが要れば、`crates/server`・"
"`crates/cli` で直して次の版を出す。"
msgstr ""
"**0.8.x is no longer released**: the code of the 0.8.x server and of the CLI "
"for the 0.8.x API has been removed, so there is no way to fix and release "
"it. If a fix is needed, make it in `crates/server` and `crates/cli` and "
"release the next version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**機微な物が出てしまった時**: GitHub の package の画面で、その版を消す。CLI "
"の方なら、release の画面で付いた file を消す。秘密なら、すぐ替える（消して"
"も、pull した人の手元には残る前提で動く）。直して次の版を出し、`ci/` の決まり"
"に、同じ物を止める形を足す。"
msgstr ""
"**If something sensitive got out**: Delete that version on the GitHub "
"package page. For the CLI, delete the attached files on the release page. If "
"it is a secret, rotate it immediately (act on the assumption that it remains "
"on the machines of people who pulled it, even after deletion). Fix the "
"problem and publish the next version, and add something to the rules in `ci/"
"` that blocks the same thing."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**置いた時から public**: この repo は public で、image に repo を指す label "
"を付けて置くので、package は初めの release から、だれでも pull できる"
"（v0.2.0 で確かめた。private の間に人が見る、という段は無い）。人が見られるの"
"は、tag を打つ前だけ。だから、3 の確かめを push の前に置いてあり、決まりを緩"
"める PR（`ci/` の file・`.dockerignore`・`Containerfile`）は、よく見てから "
"merge する。CLI の binary も、release に付いた時から public。"
msgstr ""
"**Public from the moment it is pushed**: This repo is public, and the image "
"is pushed with a label pointing to the repo, so the package can be pulled by "
"anyone from the very first release (verified with v0.2.0; there is no stage "
"where a person reviews it while it is still private). A person can review it "
"only before the tag is created. That is why the checks in step 3 are placed "
"before the push, and why PRs that loosen the rules (files in `ci/`, "
"`.dockerignore`, `Containerfile`) are reviewed carefully before merging. The "
"CLI binary is also public from the moment it is attached to a release."

#: src/release.md
msgid "切り替え（済み）"
msgstr "Switch-over (done)"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"1.0.0 で、0.8.x の server から、Smithy の定義から作る server（`crates/"
"server`。API も DB の移行の SQL もみな替わった）に切り替えた（AI-36）。"
"castlist を先に 1.0.0 に替えてから、pagetray を替えた（1.0.0 の置き場は、送り"
"手を castlist の新しい API で聞く）。"
msgstr ""
"In 1.0.0, pagetray switched from the 0.8.x server to the server built from "
"the Smithy model (`crates/server`; the API and the DB migration SQL all "
"changed) (AI-36). castlist was switched to 1.0.0 first, then pagetray (the "
"1.0.0 store asks castlist for senders through castlist's new API)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"0.8.x の server の `GET /api/backup` で写しを取り、v1.0.0 の image の "
"`migrate` で新しい volume `pagetray-data-v1` に移し、その volume で 1.0.0 を"
"起こした（`-e PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL=http://castlist.box:8080` を付けて）。"
"`migrate` は、写した後に表ごとの行の数と中身の digest・本文の SHA-256・索引・"
"時刻・外のキー・新しい API の形を照らし、1 つでも合わなければ何も足さずに 1 "
"で終わる。"
msgstr ""
"A copy was taken with the 0.8.x server's `GET /api/backup`, moved into the "
"new volume `pagetray-data-v1` with the v1.0.0 image's `migrate`, and 1.0.0 "
"was started on that volume (with `-e PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL=http://"
"castlist.box:8080`). After copying, `migrate` checks the row counts and "
"content digests of each table, the SHA-256 of the bodies, the index, the "
"times, the foreign keys, and the shape of the new API, and if even one does "
"not match, it adds nothing and exits with 1."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"切り替えの前の volume `pagetray-data` は 2026-11-26 に消した。1.0.0 より前に"
"戻す道は無い。"
msgstr ""
"The volume from before the switch-over, `pagetray-data`, was deleted on "
"2026-11-26. There is no way back to a version before 1.0.0."

#: src/release.md
msgid "image に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the image"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image は外に出す物なので、入ってよい物を決めてあり、CI（job `image` と "
"release の `check`。どちらも `ci/check-image.sh`）が毎回確かめる。1 つでも違"
"えば落ちる。"
msgstr ""
"The image is something that goes out, so what may go into it is fixed, and "
"CI (the job `image` and the release's `check`, both with `ci/check-"
"image.sh`) verifies it every time. If even one thing differs, it fails."

#: src/release.md
msgid "見る物"
msgstr "Checked item"

#: src/release.md
msgid "書いてある所"
msgstr "Defined in"

#: src/release.md
msgid "build の中に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the build"

#: src/release.md
msgid "名指した source だけ（履歴・CI の設定・試験・手元の file は入れない）"
msgstr ""
"Only the explicitly named sources (no history, CI configuration, tests, or "
"local files)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`.dockerignore`"
msgstr "`.dockerignore`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "image の file"
msgstr "Files in the image"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary 1 つ（`pagetray-server`）と、空の `/data` だけ。layer は 2 枚"
msgstr "Only one binary (`pagetray-server`) and an empty `/data`. Two layers"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/image-contents.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/image-contents.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"環境変数は DB の path と待ち受けの 2 つだけ。label は "
"`org.opencontainers.image.source`・`version`・`revision` だけ。開ける port "
"は 8080 だけ"
msgstr ""
"Only two environment variables: the DB path and the listen address. Only the "
"labels `org.opencontainers.image.source`, `version`, and `revision`. Only "
"port 8080 is exposed"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/check-image.sh` の頭"
msgstr "Top of `ci/check-image.sh`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary の中の字"
msgstr "Strings in the binary"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"home の path・mail の形・秘密の鍵や token の頭が無い。gitleaks も掛ける"
"（source にも）"
msgstr ""
"No home paths, email-like strings, or prefixes of secret keys or tokens. "
"gitleaks is also run (on the source as well)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/strings-deny.txt`・`ci/strings-allow.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/strings-deny.txt`, `ci/strings-allow.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"build に秘密は要らない。`Containerfile` に `ARG` を書かず、`--build-arg`・`--"
"secret` を使わない。label は、release の workflow が `--label` で付ける 3 つ"
"だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The build needs no secrets. Do not write `ARG` in the `Containerfile`, and "
"do not use `--build-arg` or `--secret`. The only labels are the three that "
"the release workflow adds with `--label`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"出どころの記録（provenance・SBOM）は付けない。付ける時は、中身を見てから。"
msgstr ""
"No origin records (provenance, SBOM) are attached. If you add them, inspect "
"their contents first."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release の workflow は、確かめる job（書き込みの権限が無い）と、置く job"
"（`packages: write`）に分かれている。置く job は、確かめた image の file を受"
"け取って、そのまま置く。"
msgstr ""
"The release workflow is split into a job that verifies (with no write "
"permission) and a job that pushes (`packages: write`). The pushing job "
"receives the verified image file and pushes it as is."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"本物の DB やその写しを、この repo にも CI にも置かない（`.gitignore` と "
"`.dockerignore` が `*.db` を外す）。"
msgstr ""
"Never put a real DB or a backup of one in this repo or in CI (`.gitignore` "
"and `.dockerignore` exclude `*.db`)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"決まりを変える時（file を足す・通す字を足す）は、PR で見える形で上の file を"
"直す。"
msgstr ""
"To change the rules (adding a file, adding an allowed string), edit the "
"files above in a PR, where the change is visible."

#: src/release.md
msgid "release に付ける CLI に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the CLI attached to a release"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"CLI（`pagetray`。macOS の arm64 用）も外に出す物なので、image と同じに、入っ"
"てよい物を決めてある。CI の job `cli` が PR ごとに、release の `check-cli` が"
"出す前に、同じ script で確かめる。1 つでも違えば落ちる。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI (`pagetray`, for macOS arm64) is also something that goes out, so, "
"as with the image, what may go into it is fixed. The CI job `cli` verifies "
"it on every PR, and the release's `check-cli` verifies it before publishing, "
"with the same scripts. If even one thing differs, it fails."

#: src/release.md
msgid "build"
msgstr "build"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"home と repo の path を、決まった名に付け替えて作る（Rust は source の path "
"を binary に埋め込むので、そのままだと build した人の home の path が出る）。"
"秘密は渡さない"
msgstr ""
"Built with the home and repo paths remapped to fixed names (Rust embeds "
"source paths in the binary, so otherwise the home path of whoever built it "
"would get out). No secrets are passed"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/build-cli.sh`"
msgstr "`ci/build-cli.sh`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary の形"
msgstr "Binary format"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"macOS の arm64 の実行 file。つながる library は OS の物だけ。`--version` が "
"`Cargo.toml` の版と同じ"
msgstr ""
"A macOS arm64 executable. The only linked libraries are those of the OS. `--"
"version` matches the version in `Cargo.toml`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/check-cli.sh`・`ci/cli-libs.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/check-cli.sh`, `ci/cli-libs.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image の binary と同じ決まり（home の path・mail の形・秘密の鍵や token の頭"
"が無い。gitleaks も掛ける）。同じ script を使う"
msgstr ""
"The same rules as the image's binary (no home paths, no email-like strings, "
"no private-key or token prefixes; gitleaks is run as well). The same script "
"is used"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/scan-binary.sh`・`ci/strings-deny.txt`・`ci/strings-allow.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/scan-binary.sh`, `ci/strings-deny.txt`, `ci/strings-allow.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "tar の中身"
msgstr "Contents of the tar"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray` と `LICENSE` だけ。持ち主は `root`/`wheel` に固定し、macOS が足す"
"付け足しの file を入れない"
msgstr ""
"Only `pagetray` and `LICENSE`. The owner is fixed to `root`/`wheel`, and the "
"extra files macOS adds are left out"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/pack-cli.sh`・`ci/cli-contents.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/pack-cli.sh`, `ci/cli-contents.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "動くか"
msgstr "Whether it runs"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"その binary を、同じ commit の新しい server に向けて打つ（CLI の試験。"
"`PAGETRAY_TEST_BIN` に出す binary を渡す）"
msgstr ""
"That binary is run against the new server from the same commit (the CLI "
"tests; the published binary is passed in `PAGETRAY_TEST_BIN`)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`crates/cli/tests/`"
msgstr "`crates/cli/tests/`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`check-cli` は、書き込みの権限も秘密も持たない。`push` は、渡された tar の "
"checksum を見てから、作り直さずに release に付ける。"
msgstr ""
"`check-cli` has neither write permission nor secrets. `push` verifies the "
"checksum of the tar handed to it and attaches it to the release without "
"rebuilding."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"CLI は、認証の token も設定の file も持たない。build の時に binary に焼き込む"
"値は、版だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI holds neither an authentication token nor a configuration file. The "
"only value baked into the binary at build time is the version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"署名は linker が付ける ad-hoc の物だけで、公証はしていない。出どころの記録"
"（provenance）も付けない。"
msgstr ""
"The only signature is the ad-hoc one added by the linker; it is not "
"notarized. No provenance record is attached either."

#: src/development.md
msgid "ファイル"
msgstr "File"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/`"
msgstr "`crates/server/`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"server（package と binary `pagetray-server`）。image（`Containerfile`）に `/"
"pagetray-server` の名で入る"
msgstr ""
"The server (package and binary `pagetray-server`). Goes into the image "
"(`Containerfile`) under the name `/pagetray-server`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/main.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/main.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "起こす binary。設定を読む・起こす・止める"
msgstr "The startup binary. Reads the settings, starts, and stops"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/lib.rs`・`guard.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/lib.rs`, `guard.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"道筋（生成した骨と手の道を 1 つの Router に並べる）と、この Mac の中からの要"
"求だけを受ける守りの層"
msgstr ""
"Routes (the generated skeleton and the hand-written routes in one Router), "
"and the guard layer that accepts only requests from within this Mac"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/db.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/db.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "接続・移行・SQL。ほかの版の server の DB を断る所も"
msgstr ""
"Connections, migrations, and SQL, including refusing a DB from another "
"version of the server"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"`crates/server/src/pages.rs`・`files.rs`・`list.rs`・`search.rs`・"
"`marks.rs`・`remove.rs`"
msgstr ""
"`crates/server/src/pages.rs`, `files.rs`, `list.rs`, `search.rs`, "
"`marks.rs`, `remove.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"ページと file を置く・探す・印を書く・消す（生成した操作の handler）と、ペー"
"ジの本文・file の中身を返す道"
msgstr ""
"Putting, searching, marking, and deleting pages and files (the handlers of "
"the generated operations), and the routes that return page bodies and file "
"contents"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/castlist.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/castlist.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"置かれる時に、送り手を castlist に聞く（castlist の定義から作った client で。"
"1 秒まで待つ）。聞く先と、画面の link の頭の設定を読む"
msgstr ""
"Asks castlist for the sender when something is put (with the client built "
"from castlist's model; waits up to 1 second). Reads the settings for the "
"address asked and for the base of the links in the UI"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/hand.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/hand.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "手の道の DB の写し（`GET /api/backup`）と記録（`GET /api/logs`）"
msgstr ""
"The hand-written routes for the DB copy (`GET /api/backup`) and the logs "
"(`GET /api/logs`)"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/ui.rs`・`facets.rs`・`templates/index.html`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/ui.rs`, `facets.rs`, `templates/index.html`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "一覧の UI（askama の template。build の時に検査される）"
msgstr "The list UI (an askama template; checked at build time)"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/events.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/events.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "新着の push（SSE）"
msgstr "Push of new arrivals (SSE)"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/server/src/text.rs`"
msgstr "`crates/server/src/text.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid "HTML から題と検索用の字を取り出す"
msgstr "Extracts the title and the search text from HTML"

#: src/development.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`crates/server/migrations/`"
msgstr "`crates/server/migrations/`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"表を作る SQL（起きる時に、まだ当てていない物を当てる）。できる表は [DB の作"
"り](db.md)"
msgstr ""
"SQL that creates the tables (on startup, those not yet applied are applied). "
"The resulting tables are in [DB schema](db.md)"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`crates/cli/`"
msgstr "`crates/cli/`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"人が打つ CLI（package と binary `pagetray`。[CLI](cli.md)）。`crates/"
"pagetray-client/` で呼ぶ。release に付く。試験は、同じ commit の server を起"
"こして打つ"
msgstr ""
"The CLI that people type (package and binary `pagetray`; [CLI](cli.md)). It "
"calls through `crates/pagetray-client/`. Attached to releases. Its tests "
"start the server from the same commit and run the CLI against it"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`model/`・`ci/gen.sh`"
msgstr "`model/`, `ci/gen.sh`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"API の Smithy の定義と、そこから crate を作る script（下の「定義と生成」）"
msgstr ""
"The Smithy model of the API, and the script that makes crates from it (see "
"\"Model and generation\" below)"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"`crates/pagetray-sdk/`・`crates/castlist-client/`・`crates/pagetray-client/`"
msgstr ""
"`crates/pagetray-sdk/`, `crates/castlist-client/`, `crates/pagetray-client/`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"定義から作った server の骨と、castlist を呼ぶ crate と、pagetray を呼ぶ crate"
"（CLI が使う）。手で直さない"
msgstr ""
"The server skeleton generated from the model, the crate that calls castlist, "
"and the crate that calls pagetray (used by the CLI). Not edited by hand"

#: src/development.md
msgid "`e2e/`"
msgstr "`e2e/`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI と、この本を、本物の browser で見る試験（Playwright・TypeScript）。"
"image にも CLI にも入らない。流し方は下の「一覧の UI の試験」と「この本を直"
"す」の「本の試験」"
msgstr ""
"Tests that look at the list UI and this book in a real browser (Playwright, "
"TypeScript). They go into neither the image nor the CLI. How to run them is "
"in \"List UI tests\" below and in \"Book tests\" under \"Editing this book\""

