"出す image と、release に付ける CLI に、入ってよい物だけが入っているか・動く"
"かを見る script と、その決まり。この本を build する script（`ci/docs-"
"build.sh`）もここ"
msgstr ""
"Scripts that check that the published image and the CLI attached to a "
"release contain only what is allowed and that they run, along with their "
"rules. The script that builds this book (`ci/docs-build.sh`) is also here"

