#: src/db.md
msgid "`answered_at`"
msgstr "`answered_at`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "答えた時刻。まだ答えていなければ空（0.5.0 から）"
msgstr "When it was answered. Null if not answered yet (since 0.5.0)"

#: src/db.md
msgid "`sender_id`"
msgstr "`sender_id`"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"送り手（`senders.id`）。付随する id を書かずに置いたページと、0.6.0 より前に"
"置かれたページは空"
msgstr ""
"Sender (`senders.id`). Null for pages put without an attached id and for "
"pages put before 0.6.0"

#: src/db.md
msgid "`waits_on`"
msgstr "`waits_on`"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"誰の返事を待つか（`review`・`tpm`）。空は Product Manager（0.8.0 から。前から"
"あるページは空）"
msgstr ""
"Whose reply the page is waiting for (`review` or `tpm`). Null means the "
"Product Manager (since 0.8.0; null on pages that existed before)"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"レビューの判定（`approve`・`concerns`・`reject`・`not-assessed`）。書いていな"
"ければ空（0.8.0 から）"
msgstr ""
"The review verdict (`approve`, `concerns`, `reject`, `not-assessed`). Null "
"if not written (since 0.8.0)"

#: src/db.md
msgid "主キー: `(id)`"
msgstr "Primary key: `(id)`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "一意: `(project, key, kind, n)`"
msgstr "Unique: `(project, key, kind, n)`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "索引: `pages_created` `(created_at)`"
msgstr "Index: `pages_created` `(created_at)`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "索引: `pages_waiting` `(asked_at)`"
msgstr "Index: `pages_waiting` `(asked_at)`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "索引: `pages_sender` `(sender_id)`"
msgstr "Index: `pages_sender` `(sender_id)`"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"`pages_waiting` は、返事待ち（`asked_at` があり、`answered_at` が空）の行だけ"
"の索引。"
msgstr ""
"`pages_waiting` is an index over only the rows waiting for a reply "
"(`asked_at` set, `answered_at` null)."

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"書く所: `Db::put_page`・`Db::set_reply`（返事の状態だけ）・`Db::add_marks`"
"（判定だけ）。読む所: `Db::body`・`Db::list`・`Db::facets`。消す所: "
"`Db::remove`。"
msgstr ""
"Written by `Db::put_page`, `Db::set_reply` (the reply state only), and "
"`Db::add_marks` (the verdict only). Read by `Db::body`, `Db::list`, "
"`Db::facets`. Deleted by `Db::remove`."

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"**返事の状態**: `asked_at` も `answered_at` も空なら、返事を求めていないペー"
"ジ。`asked_at` があり `answered_at` が空なら返事待ち。`answered_at` があれば"
"答えた。0.5.0 より前に置かれたページは、どちらも空。誰の返事かは `waits_on` "
"で読み、「返事待ち」「答えた」の数と絞り込み（`on` の無い `reply`）は、"
"`waits_on` が空（Product Manager）の行だけを見る。"
msgstr ""
"**Reply state**: with both `asked_at` and `answered_at` null, no reply was "
"asked for. With `asked_at` set and `answered_at` null, the page is waiting "
"for a reply. With `answered_at` set, it has been answered. Pages put before "
"0.5.0 have both null. Whose reply it is comes from `waits_on`; the counts "
"and filters for \"Waiting for reply\" and \"Answered\" (`reply` without "
"`on`) look only at rows whose `waits_on` is null (the Product Manager)."

#: src/db.md
msgid "`waits_on`・`verdict` は、SQL の `check` で上の名だけを受ける。"
msgstr ""
"`waits_on` and `verdict` accept only the names above, through an SQL `check`."

#: src/db.md
msgid "`pages_fts` — 全文の索引"
msgstr "`pages_fts` — full-text index"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"[全文の索引](glossary.md)（SQLite の FTS5 の仮想の表）。`tokenize='trigram'` "
"で字を 3 字ずつに切るので、日本語の語も引ける。ページ 1 枚が 1 行で、`rowid` "
"が `pages.id`。"
msgstr ""
"The [full-text index](glossary.md) (an SQLite FTS5 virtual table). "
"`tokenize='trigram'` splits text into 3-character pieces, so Japanese words "
"can be looked up too. One row per page, and `rowid` is `pages.id`."

#: src/db.md
msgid "`pages.title` の写し"
msgstr "Copy of `pages.title`"

#: src/db.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"本文から tag・script・style を除いた字（`crates/server/src/text.rs`）。本文そ"
"のものは持たない"
msgstr ""
"Body text with tags, scripts, and styles removed (`crates/server/src/"
"text.rs`). The body itself is not kept here"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"書く所: `Db::put_page`（`pages` と同じ取引）。読む所: `Db::list`（探す語が 3 "
"字以上なら索引で引き、短い語があれば端から見る）。消す所: `Db::remove`。"
msgstr ""
"Written by `Db::put_page` (in the same transaction as `pages`). Read by "
"`Db::list` (uses the index when every search word has 3 or more characters, "
"and scans when a word is shorter). Deleted by `Db::remove`."

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"FTS5 が、中身を持つ影の表（`pages_fts_data`・`pages_fts_idx`・"
"`pages_fts_content`・`pages_fts_docsize`・`pages_fts_config`）を作る。手で触"
"らない。"
msgstr ""
"FTS5 creates shadow tables that hold the contents (`pages_fts_data`, "
"`pages_fts_idx`, `pages_fts_content`, `pages_fts_docsize`, "
"`pages_fts_config`). Do not touch them by hand."

#: src/db.md
msgid "`removed` — 消したページの番号"
msgstr "`removed` — numbers of removed pages"

#: src/db.md
msgid ""
"消したページ 1 枚が 1 行。本文は持たない。同じ番号を 2 度使わない（古い URL "
"が別のページを指さない）ためと、消したページの URL に `410` を返すため。"
msgstr ""
"One row per removed page, without the body. Kept so that no number is used "
"twice (an old URL never points to a different page) and so that a removed "
"page's URL returns `410`."

#: src/db.md
