"書く所: `Db::remove`。読む所: `Db::put_page`（番号を決める時・取り込みで名指"
"された番号を断る時）・`Db::removed_at`（`410` を返す時）。"
msgstr ""
"Written by `Db::remove`. Read by `Db::put_page` (when choosing a number, and "
"when refusing a number named in an import) and `Db::removed_at` (when "
"returning `410`)."

#: src/db.md
